(5453644, 785084, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute squirrel; like the DOF and composition.  Not a lot of movement here, however.  Wild animals can be *so* uncooperative!</td>', 'Cute squirrel; like the DOF and composition.  Not a lot of movement here, however.  Wild animals can be *so* uncooperative!', '2009-04-27 09:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453645, 785526, 43774, '<td valign="top">If you are going to go with selective desaturation you should get it right......I can see many areas that you missed and that really detracts from the photo.<br/> <br/>Good action shot but the editing ruins the photo for me, sorry.</td>', 'If you are going to go with selective desaturation you should get it right......I can see many areas that you missed and that really detracts from the photo. Good action shot but the editing ruins the photo for me, sorry.', '2009-04-27 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453660, 785525, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ooh, tough exposure.  The Mallard and his motion are well-captured and I like the light on him.  He is disappearing into the background, though, which is good for him in the real world of predators but not so great photographically.  Maybe shooting with less DOF would have blurred the background sufficiently for him to stand out better?</td>', 'Ooh, tough exposure.  The Mallard and his motion are well-captured and I like the light on him.  He is disappearing into the background, though, which is good for him in the real world of predators but not so great photographically.  Maybe shooting with less DOF would have blurred the background sufficiently for him to stand out better?', '2009-04-27 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453665, 784885, 65234, '<td valign="top">Handsome fellow; very sleek-looking.  Shot seems a little soft to me.</td>', 'Handsome fellow; very sleek-looking.  Shot seems a little soft to me.', '2009-04-27 09:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453671, 785513, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like Sophia is about to go SPLAT!  But cats seem to be able to recoveri n mid-air more often than not.  Not sure what I think about all the noise; I suspect I''d like it better if there weren''t parts of the chair in rather sharp focus.  Kind of surreal and intriguing that the cat''s not casting a shadow.</td>', 'Looks like Sophia is about to go SPLAT!  But cats seem to be able to recoveri n mid-air more often than not.  Not sure what I think about all the noise; I suspect I''d like it better if there weren''t parts of the chair in rather sharp focus.  Kind of surreal and intriguing that the cat''s not casting a shadow.', '2009-04-27 09:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5453689, 785343, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Motion definitely means something different to a tortoise (and I just voted on a hare; how funny is that?).</td>', 'LOL!  Motion definitely means something different to a tortoise (and I just voted on a hare; how funny is that?).', '2009-04-27 09:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
