(5453713, 785431, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the pink in the near wing, and you got a nice catchlight in the eye.  Not really fond of the stark tree in the background; assuming the bird didn''t offer you a better shot I''d play with different crops and angles to make the composition more interesting and play down the tree.</td>', 'Love the pink in the near wing, and you got a nice catchlight in the eye.  Not really fond of the stark tree in the background; assuming the bird didn''t offer you a better shot I''d play with different crops and angles to make the composition more interesting and play down the tree.', '2009-04-27 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
