(5454406, 785572, 62787, '<td valign="top">I''m in love with this picture (and not just because of the username either :p)<br/>Artistic and beautifully soft, yet bursting with colour - the sort of thing I wouldn''t mind hanging up on my wall.</td>', 'I''m in love with this picture (and not just because of the username either :p)Artistic and beautifully soft, yet bursting with colour - the sort of thing I wouldn''t mind hanging up on my wall.', '2009-04-27 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454431, 785503, 62787, '<td valign="top">Wow, stunning. Love the colours.</td>', 'Wow, stunning. Love the colours.', '2009-04-27 20:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454439, 785201, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beauty, grace and style seems to be the watchwords so far in this challenge and this image meets that expectation perfectly. While the image is just slightly over sharpened, it is still a technical and artistic success worthy of ribbon contention. Well done.</td>', 'Beauty, grace and style seems to be the watchwords so far in this challenge and this image meets that expectation perfectly. While the image is just slightly over sharpened, it is still a technical and artistic success worthy of ribbon contention. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454441, 785527, 101256, '<td valign="top">Eadweard Muybridge in 1872 settled a bet on whether a horse ever has all four feet off the ground at the same time. This is a perfect example of that which is still argued today. A richly detailed and dramatic image, this demonstrates the beauty, grace and style of a running horse in the Sport of Kings. A beautiful image technically and artistically perfect. A top prize contender. Well done.</td>', 'Eadweard Muybridge in 1872 settled a bet on whether a horse ever has all four feet off the ground at the same time. This is a perfect example of that which is still argued today. A richly detailed and dramatic image, this demonstrates the beauty, grace and style of a running horse in the Sport of Kings. A beautiful image technically and artistically perfect. A top prize contender. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454444, 785343, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sense of humor is always appreciated and this certainly is laugh out loud funny. A terrific image full of humor and whimsy, it only needs a rabbit to complete the trifecta of comedy, humor and laughter. Very clever and given a 10 just because it''s so different. Terrific - well done.</td>', 'A sense of humor is always appreciated and this certainly is laugh out loud funny. A terrific image full of humor and whimsy, it only needs a rabbit to complete the trifecta of comedy, humor and laughter. Very clever and given a 10 just because it''s so different. Terrific - well done.', '2009-04-27 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454448, 785293, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, richly detailed and well composed showing the beauty and grace inherent in the Border Collie breed. A terrific imge and worthy of a ribbon - great angle and a complete technical and artistic success.  Well done.<br/> <br/>I try very hard to stay in the third person and be as neutral as possible, but this image brought tears to my eyes. I recently lost my red Border Collie Duke to a stroke - best dog I ever had. He was as intense as he was friendly, happy and fun to be with - he ran Agility courses with boundless energy and concentration always having fun and doing his very best - he was my best friend forever. This image evokes his memory in ways I just can''t describe - he was with me for thirteen wonderful and memory filled years and I miss him terribly. Thank you for this wonderful image.</td>', 'A beautiful image, richly detailed and well composed showing the beauty and grace inherent in the Border Collie breed. A terrific imge and worthy of a ribbon - great angle and a complete technical and artistic success.  Well done. I try very hard to stay in the third person and be as neutral as possible, but this image brought tears to my eyes. I recently lost my red Border Collie Duke to a stroke - best dog I ever had. He was as intense as he was friendly, happy and fun to be with - he ran Agility courses with boundless energy and concentration always having fun and doing his very best - he was my best friend forever. This image evokes his memory in ways I just can''t describe - he was with me for thirteen wonderful and memory filled years and I miss him terribly. Thank you for this wonderful image.', '2009-04-27 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454451, 785020, 101256, '<td valign="top">Audubon perfect, this is an amazing image richly detailed, properly framed and composed with nothing out of place and technically perfect. It has a great deal of artistic impact and is as stunningly beautiful the third or fourth viewing as it was on the first. A complete artistic and technical success demonstrating motion, grace, and beauty. Well done.</td>', 'Audubon perfect, this is an amazing image richly detailed, properly framed and composed with nothing out of place and technically perfect. It has a great deal of artistic impact and is as stunningly beautiful the third or fourth viewing as it was on the first. A complete artistic and technical success demonstrating motion, grace, and beauty. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454456, 784061, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific image of a feline Barishnikov - richly detailed with nothing out of place from both a technical and artistic standpoint - a complete success in every way. Well done.</td>', 'A terrific image of a feline Barishnikov - richly detailed with nothing out of place from both a technical and artistic standpoint - a complete success in every way. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454457, 785265, 101256, '<td valign="top">An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose behind the leap. An amazing image perfectly captured. One minor little technical issue in that the image is just slightly oversharpened, it is none the less a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose behind the leap. An amazing image perfectly captured. One minor little technical issue in that the image is just slightly oversharpened, it is none the less a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454458, 785265, 31637, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an athlete! 7</td>', 'Wow, what an athlete! 7', '2009-04-27 20:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454460, 785560, 101256, '<td valign="top">Funny is good - humor always trumps technical and artistic imperfections. While overly busy, the content is hilarious and has some not so minor laugh out loud details. A greate capture and worth every single point of it''s rating. Well done.</td>', 'Funny is good - humor always trumps technical and artistic imperfections. While overly busy, the content is hilarious and has some not so minor laugh out loud details. A greate capture and worth every single point of it''s rating. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454461, 785503, 101256, '<td valign="top">If the subject were a little lighter, or a little different angle to get a little better light, this would have been a perfect action image demonstrating poetry in motion. Richly detailed, it is a complete artistic success showing the natural beauty of a bird in flight. The vaugely detailed background is a huge plus and compliments the bird perfectly. A technical success with a minor exception and a complete artistic success - a ribbon contender by rights. Well done.</td>', 'If the subject were a little lighter, or a little different angle to get a little better light, this would have been a perfect action image demonstrating poetry in motion. Richly detailed, it is a complete artistic success showing the natural beauty of a bird in flight. The vaugely detailed background is a huge plus and compliments the bird perfectly. A technical success with a minor exception and a complete artistic success - a ribbon contender by rights. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454463, 785248, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this was rated as a 9 because the initial impression was that the image was oversharpened. On third review, this was a mistaken impression - the image is so technically perfect that the casual view can mistake the detail for sharpening problems. A stunningly beautiful image showing the grace and power of a beautiful animal. A complete technical and artistic success - rerated from a 9 to a 10. Well done.</td>', 'At first glance, this was rated as a 9 because the initial impression was that the image was oversharpened. On third review, this was a mistaken impression - the image is so technically perfect that the casual view can mistake the detail for sharpening problems. A stunningly beautiful image showing the grace and power of a beautiful animal. A complete technical and artistic success - rerated from a 9 to a 10. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454474, 785566, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s just better to let the image speak for itself. A perfect blend of action and still life, it''s a terrific natural world capture not often seen even in the hallowed halls of the Audubon Society gallery. While the focus is a little off, that is only to be expected. A slightly better crop would help. Those are minor issues however. A technical and artistic success - well done.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s just better to let the image speak for itself. A perfect blend of action and still life, it''s a terrific natural world capture not often seen even in the hallowed halls of the Audubon Society gallery. While the focus is a little off, that is only to be expected. A slightly better crop would help. Those are minor issues however. A technical and artistic success - well done.', '2009-04-27 20:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454479, 784926, 101256, '<td valign="top">Visually stunning, there are little minor details that negatively affect this image - such as the red around the rock and the excess "leftovers" on the left side of the right. This reviewer thinks that the overly blank background, while not a poor choice, is over done and detracts somewhat from the image''s overall artistic impact. Still, it is an excellant capture and even with the minor technical and artistic issues, it''s well worth it''s rating. Well done.</td>', 'Visually stunning, there are little minor details that negatively affect this image - such as the red around the rock and the excess "leftovers" on the left side of the right. This reviewer thinks that the overly blank background, while not a poor choice, is over done and detracts somewhat from the image''s overall artistic impact. Still, it is an excellant capture and even with the minor technical and artistic issues, it''s well worth it''s rating. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454486, 784885, 73235, '<td valign="top">I think there are a couple of things that let your picture down: e.g. you cut off the dog''s legs, the dog is looking right out of the picture, the focal plane isquite a bit behind the dog. I liked that you kept the background clean and simple.</td>', 'I think there are a couple of things that let your picture down: e.g. you cut off the dog''s legs, the dog is looking right out of the picture, the focal plane isquite a bit behind the dog. I liked that you kept the background clean and simple.', '2009-04-27 20:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454487, 785120, 73235, '<td valign="top">What a proud beauty. The backlighting works great here in this high contrast shot. shutter is fast enough to freeze the motion.</td>', 'What a proud beauty. The backlighting works great here in this high contrast shot. shutter is fast enough to freeze the motion.', '2009-04-27 20:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454490, 784656, 101256, '<td valign="top">This reviewer was wondering how many really good dog photos there would be in this challenge and it''s been a joy reviewing so many great images. Two friends having a lot of fun, it demonstrates the joy of being able to run without barriers and play without fear. A terific capture and one worth every point of it''s rating. Well done.</td>', 'This reviewer was wondering how many really good dog photos there would be in this challenge and it''s been a joy reviewing so many great images. Two friends having a lot of fun, it demonstrates the joy of being able to run without barriers and play without fear. A terific capture and one worth every point of it''s rating. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454491, 784259, 73235, '<td valign="top">great timing with the wings spread wide and the focus to the nest. good composition</td>', 'great timing with the wings spread wide and the focus to the nest. good composition', '2009-04-27 20:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454493, 784874, 73235, '<td valign="top">quite an accomplishment getting this feelow sharp in flight.</td>', 'quite an accomplishment getting this feelow sharp in flight.', '2009-04-27 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454497, 785581, 73235, '<td valign="top">tough shot against a bright sky like this. But you managed to catch quite some detail here.</td>', 'tough shot against a bright sky like this. But you managed to catch quite some detail here.', '2009-04-27 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454499, 785459, 101256, '<td valign="top">Rich in detail and an excellant conversion, this image is a complete technical and artistic success. Everything is well controlled and the erratic nature of the sea gull is difficult to capture and the author has done well to frame this image perfectly. A great entry into the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Rich in detail and an excellant conversion, this image is a complete technical and artistic success. Everything is well controlled and the erratic nature of the sea gull is difficult to capture and the author has done well to frame this image perfectly. A great entry into the challenge. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454501, 785191, 73235, '<td valign="top">I think here a tilted horizon could enhance the angle of the run. Just a thought. good shutter speed to freeze the motion.</td>', 'I think here a tilted horizon could enhance the angle of the run. Just a thought. good shutter speed to freeze the motion.', '2009-04-27 20:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454505, 785263, 73235, '<td valign="top">good eye to see and capture this shot. is that synchronized flying? :)</td>', 'good eye to see and capture this shot. is that synchronized flying? :)', '2009-04-27 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454506, 784737, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454508, 785453, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
