(5454513, 785531, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image.  Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would be the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image.  Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would be the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-27 20:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
