(5454518, 785586, 73235, '<td valign="top">Someone had a lot of fun here. I like  your focus on the eyes and nose</td>', 'Someone had a lot of fun here. I like  your focus on the eyes and nose', '2009-04-27 21:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454520, 784713, 73235, '<td valign="top">Now which motion did you catch here: yours backing off or the horses moving in ? :)))<br/>Guess you know already that this is a cool perspective.</td>', 'Now which motion did you catch here: yours backing off or the horses moving in ? :)))Guess you know already that this is a cool perspective.', '2009-04-27 21:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454522, 784767, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has done well to reduce the over done highlights inherent in this type of image of splashing fish. A little overly busy, it might have been better to attempt a capture with fewer fish, but it works as it is. Rich in detail which is a plus. Technically a difficult capture, the author has done well to reduce the potential side effects of too much action in too little space. Not a perfect image, but very close. Well done.</td>', 'The author has done well to reduce the over done highlights inherent in this type of image of splashing fish. A little overly busy, it might have been better to attempt a capture with fewer fish, but it works as it is. Rich in detail which is a plus. Technically a difficult capture, the author has done well to reduce the potential side effects of too much action in too little space. Not a perfect image, but very close. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454525, 785480, 73235, '<td valign="top">That fellow must have run real fast. I like the warm tones.</td>', 'That fellow must have run real fast. I like the warm tones.', '2009-04-27 21:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454529, 785583, 73235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I am glad you chose your shutter to keep the tip of the wings in motion. Focus is spot on</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I am glad you chose your shutter to keep the tip of the wings in motion. Focus is spot on', '2009-04-27 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454531, 785485, 101256, '<td valign="top">An Audubon quality capture, this is simple stunning. A perfect background well controlled puts the emphasis on the bird and suits the over all mood of the image perfectly. Rich in detail with no major or minor technical issues. At first, the artistic impression wasn''t quite as good, but on a third viewing, this reviewer has changed the rating from a 9 to a 10. A top ten if not a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'An Audubon quality capture, this is simple stunning. A perfect background well controlled puts the emphasis on the bird and suits the over all mood of the image perfectly. Rich in detail with no major or minor technical issues. At first, the artistic impression wasn''t quite as good, but on a third viewing, this reviewer has changed the rating from a 9 to a 10. A top ten if not a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454532, 785475, 73235, '<td valign="top">great processing, looks like a watercolor painting</td>', 'great processing, looks like a watercolor painting', '2009-04-27 21:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454534, 784654, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this image came across as over sharpened, but on review, this was a mistaken impression. The intensity of the bird''s eyes, the rich and in depth detail, the perfectly composed background demonstrates how to capture motion perfectly. While the image could use a little better crop on the left, it works perfectly as is. Originally rated a 9, it has been rerated a 10. Well done - a top ten contender and a potential ribbon winner.</td>', 'At first glance, this image came across as over sharpened, but on review, this was a mistaken impression. The intensity of the bird''s eyes, the rich and in depth detail, the perfectly composed background demonstrates how to capture motion perfectly. While the image could use a little better crop on the left, it works perfectly as is. Originally rated a 9, it has been rerated a 10. Well done - a top ten contender and a potential ribbon winner.', '2009-04-27 21:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454535, 785547, 73235, '<td valign="top">well done freezing the motion. If I had to ask for one thing: I wish the dove was in the right side of your shot. BUT it''s easier said than done. I know. Spot on focus</td>', 'well done freezing the motion. If I had to ask for one thing: I wish the dove was in the right side of your shot. BUT it''s easier said than done. I know. Spot on focus', '2009-04-27 21:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454540, 785084, 73235, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture with the focus where it should be. 2 comments: it still apears a little soft as the focal plain seems to be slightly in front of the squirrel and the pictures seems overly warm. THis one you ight have done on purpose, not sure.</td>', 'Very nice capture with the focus where it should be. 2 comments: it still apears a little soft as the focal plain seems to be slightly in front of the squirrel and the pictures seems overly warm. THis one you ight have done on purpose, not sure.', '2009-04-27 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454541, 785265, 37845, '<td valign="top">I just decided to look at the thumbnails, with no intention of voting yet, and this is the first one that caught my eye. My immediate reaction was "this is awesome". Really well captured, great DOF. I hope you do really well.</td>', 'I just decided to look at the thumbnails, with no intention of voting yet, and this is the first one that caught my eye. My immediate reaction was "this is awesome". Really well captured, great DOF. I hope you do really well.', '2009-04-27 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454542, 784938, 73235, '<td valign="top">I love the choice of focus. great details in the darl parts of your picture</td>', 'I love the choice of focus. great details in the darl parts of your picture', '2009-04-27 21:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454543, 785644, 101256, '<td valign="top">An amazing juxtaposition of bodies, it''s almost abstract is it feel and impact. While not technically a motion shot in it''s entirety, it certainly has those elements in it which has to be viewed positively. From a technical standpoint, it appears to have the reds over saturated indicated by the slight red halo around the lower birds breast area and the very slight red color cast on the body of the flying bird. These minor technical issues are sufficiently negative to affect the rating. From an artistic standpoint, while effective, the image lacks impact or wow factor. Still a worthy entry into the challenge as it should place within the top twenty. Well done.</td>', 'An amazing juxtaposition of bodies, it''s almost abstract is it feel and impact. While not technically a motion shot in it''s entirety, it certainly has those elements in it which has to be viewed positively. From a technical standpoint, it appears to have the reds over saturated indicated by the slight red halo around the lower birds breast area and the very slight red color cast on the body of the flying bird. These minor technical issues are sufficiently negative to affect the rating. From an artistic standpoint, while effective, the image lacks impact or wow factor. Still a worthy entry into the challenge as it should place within the top twenty. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454544, 785537, 73235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.. a tad oversharpened. There are white halos arund the edges. Good job capturing it in flight.</td>', 'Nice capture.. a tad oversharpened. There are white halos arund the edges. Good job capturing it in flight.', '2009-04-27 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454550, 784465, 73235, '<td valign="top">Oh lucky you. I went to an aquarium just last week and the hippos they had, were sleeping... for hours. well done</td>', 'Oh lucky you. I went to an aquarium just last week and the hippos they had, were sleeping... for hours. well done', '2009-04-27 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454552, 785201, 73235, '<td valign="top">great detail in your shot and thoughtful in your crop.</td>', 'great detail in your shot and thoughtful in your crop.', '2009-04-27 21:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454554, 785466, 73235, '<td valign="top">perfect timing when all legs are in the air. Doesn''t the dog look like a big ball flying? Good panning.</td>', 'perfect timing when all legs are in the air. Doesn''t the dog look like a big ball flying? Good panning.', '2009-04-27 21:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454556, 785572, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blue give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.</td>', 'Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blue give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.', '2009-04-27 21:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454560, 785107, 73235, '<td valign="top">good capture of the dog''s focus.</td>', 'good capture of the dog''s focus.', '2009-04-27 21:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454564, 785464, 73235, '<td valign="top">What a tough job to get this shallow DOF right on the caterpillar. You managed to get almost verhting in focus, well done.</td>', 'What a tough job to get this shallow DOF right on the caterpillar. You managed to get almost verhting in focus, well done.', '2009-04-27 21:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
