(5454566, 784737, 73235, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the background clean.</td>', 'Good job keeping the background clean.', '2009-04-27 21:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454567, 785508, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454576, 785120, 101256, '<td valign="top">A simply beautiful image of a beautiful animal. The white are right on the edge, the halo effect is stunning and the overall impact of beauty, grace and power is palpable. A stunning technical and artistic success - an incredible capture. Well done.</td>', 'A simply beautiful image of a beautiful animal. The white are right on the edge, the halo effect is stunning and the overall impact of beauty, grace and power is palpable. A stunning technical and artistic success - an incredible capture. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454577, 785590, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable action shot with all technical and artistic areas covered exquisitely. Incredible conversion - simply brilliant. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is unmatched.</td>', 'Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable action shot with all technical and artistic areas covered exquisitely. Incredible conversion - simply brilliant. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is unmatched.', '2009-04-27 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454578, 785476, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image, although it would do with a little more cropping on the right - that would be a personal choice however and as it is, it''s wonderful. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image, although it would do with a little more cropping on the right - that would be a personal choice however and as it is, it''s wonderful. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454580, 785525, 73235, '<td valign="top">I think the busy background does not do justice to the good capture of the ducks flight</td>', 'I think the busy background does not do justice to the good capture of the ducks flight', '2009-04-27 21:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454585, 785528, 73235, '<td valign="top">Usually I''m not a big fan of the horizon cutting right through your main subject. Here is looks good, like an extension of the lines of the duck. Very well done.</td>', 'Usually I''m not a big fan of the horizon cutting right through your main subject. Here is looks good, like an extension of the lines of the duck. Very well done.', '2009-04-27 21:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454588, 785430, 73235, '<td valign="top">Looks like the guy is locked on it''s target. Very well captured.</td>', 'Looks like the guy is locked on it''s target. Very well captured.', '2009-04-27 21:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454590, 785088, 101256, '<td valign="top">An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with darker faced dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and joy of a fun run. An amazing image perfectly captured. One minor little technical issue in that the image is just slightly oversharpened, it is none the less a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with darker faced dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and joy of a fun run. An amazing image perfectly captured. One minor little technical issue in that the image is just slightly oversharpened, it is none the less a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454594, 784959, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first, this image came across as not effective or even interesting. On a third review, this reviewer has changed rating from an 8 to a 10. A very interesting concept that needs some thought to properly evaluate. With no technical issues of note, the artistic impression is the controlling factor and with the vast expanse of space and the tiny life form in it is very compelling. It might have worked a little better if the subject was a little larger within the space provided, but then it would be a diffeent photograph. A very good composition and title. Well done.</td>', 'At first, this image came across as not effective or even interesting. On a third review, this reviewer has changed rating from an 8 to a 10. A very interesting concept that needs some thought to properly evaluate. With no technical issues of note, the artistic impression is the controlling factor and with the vast expanse of space and the tiny life form in it is very compelling. It might have worked a little better if the subject was a little larger within the space provided, but then it would be a diffeent photograph. A very good composition and title. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454596, 785345, 73235, '<td valign="top">Very hard to comment on, I have to admit. But I''ll try. THe overall impression is ... too busy and to much blur. You probably tried to capture the motion, but then atleast one part should still be sharp and in focus. And with pets, it should be the head with the eyes. THe horizon is cutting right through the puppy''s head, creating an unbalancing impression. And because the head is pointing away from the viewer the lines of the horizon and the shoulder of the dog focus the viewer on the tail of the dog. I''m pretty sure this was not your intention, right?</td>', 'Very hard to comment on, I have to admit. But I''ll try. THe overall impression is ... too busy and to much blur. You probably tried to capture the motion, but then atleast one part should still be sharp and in focus. And with pets, it should be the head with the eyes. THe horizon is cutting right through the puppy''s head, creating an unbalancing impression. And because the head is pointing away from the viewer the lines of the horizon and the shoulder of the dog focus the viewer on the tail of the dog. I''m pretty sure this was not your intention, right?', '2009-04-27 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454597, 785196, 73235, '<td valign="top">great light to bring out your subject.</td>', 'great light to bring out your subject.', '2009-04-27 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454599, 784951, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sense of humor is always appreciated and this certainly is laugh out loud funny. A terrific image full of humor and whimsy - a complete trifecta of comedy, humor and laughter. Very clever and given a 10 just because it''s so different. Terrific - well done.</td>', 'A sense of humor is always appreciated and this certainly is laugh out loud funny. A terrific image full of humor and whimsy - a complete trifecta of comedy, humor and laughter. Very clever and given a 10 just because it''s so different. Terrific - well done.', '2009-04-27 21:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
