(5454701, 785344, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Dogs having fun is a natural and this captures the open spirit and nature of pure joy of a dog''s life. They ask so little and give so much that it''s a pleasure to see an author capture them in thier natural fun loving state. A beautiful image and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-27 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
