(5454761, 785498, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s just better to let the image speak for itself. A perfect blend of action and still life, it''s a terrific natural world capture not often seen even in the hallowed halls of the Audubon Society gallery. A technical and artistic success - well done.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s just better to let the image speak for itself. A perfect blend of action and still life, it''s a terrific natural world capture not often seen even in the hallowed halls of the Audubon Society gallery. A technical and artistic success - well done.', '2009-04-27 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5454765, 785485, 40718, '<td valign="top">From the thumb I thought this had ribbon all over it.  Looking at it, I think it will do well, but the focus is just slightly off (or perhaps its the lens or motion blur).  A great pic though.  I love the colors and the wings.</td>', 'From the thumb I thought this had ribbon all over it.  Looking at it, I think it will do well, but the focus is just slightly off (or perhaps its the lens or motion blur).  A great pic though.  I love the colors and the wings.', '2009-04-27 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
