(5455471, 785466, 33672, '<td valign="top">What a happy dog.</td>', 'What a happy dog.', '2009-04-28 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455502, 785430, 79955, '<td valign="top">brilliant capture, excellent details. 8</td>', 'brilliant capture, excellent details. 8', '2009-04-28 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455504, 785531, 79955, '<td valign="top">very nice, excellent capture , 8</td>', 'very nice, excellent capture , 8', '2009-04-28 12:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455520, 785589, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach to the challenge subject if only because it''s such a natural image - it''s what dogs do. Nicely detailed and a terrific combination of color and gray scale. Probaly not to every viewer''s taste, it is a clever and unique composition. Well done.</td>', 'An interesting approach to the challenge subject if only because it''s such a natural image - it''s what dogs do. Nicely detailed and a terrific combination of color and gray scale. Probaly not to every viewer''s taste, it is a clever and unique composition. Well done.', '2009-04-28 12:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455522, 785454, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great image just slightly flawed by the water drops ahead of the duck. A good action capture, it''s properly framed with good detail and motion capture. The reflection of the wave on the surface of the water is simply unbelivable - in and of itself, a major achievement. This image could work upside down - an example of both technical and artistic excellance. Well done.</td>', 'A great image just slightly flawed by the water drops ahead of the duck. A good action capture, it''s properly framed with good detail and motion capture. The reflection of the wave on the surface of the water is simply unbelivable - in and of itself, a major achievement. This image could work upside down - an example of both technical and artistic excellance. Well done.', '2009-04-28 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455526, 785577, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable motion shot with all technical and artistic areas competantly covered. Minor technical issue with the exposure setting - it could have been tweaked just a little more to h elp with some definition on the horse, but it works as it is. Not a complete artistic success, it is a very good image none the less. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is the equal of other equine images in this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable motion shot with all technical and artistic areas competantly covered. Minor technical issue with the exposure setting - it could have been tweaked just a little more to h elp with some definition on the horse, but it works as it is. Not a complete artistic success, it is a very good image none the less. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is the equal of other equine images in this challenge. Well done.', '2009-04-28 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455527, 785263, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-28 12:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455528, 784837, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense of detail and over done action. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blur give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.</td>', 'Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense of detail and over done action. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blur give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.', '2009-04-28 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455529, 785259, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable action shot with all technical and artistic areas covered exquisitely - simply brilliant. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is unmatched.</td>', 'Another incredibly detailed - an unbelievable action shot with all technical and artistic areas covered exquisitely - simply brilliant. Congratulations on achieving a level of beauty, grace, power and style that is unmatched.', '2009-04-28 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455532, 785486, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it falls short of being an artistic success in that while a clever conversion, it fails to have any significant impact on the viewer beyond being a different snapshot. From a technical standpoint, it''s overly vague and would have been better if the body was more detailed to give some dimension and depth to the image - in addition to enhancing the pink tongue. Not quite a "motion" shot, it does elicit a positive impression.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it falls short of being an artistic success in that while a clever conversion, it fails to have any significant impact on the viewer beyond being a different snapshot. From a technical standpoint, it''s overly vague and would have been better if the body was more detailed to give some dimension and depth to the image - in addition to enhancing the pink tongue. Not quite a "motion" shot, it does elicit a positive impression.', '2009-04-28 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455534, 785581, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455535, 785559, 101256, '<td valign="top">A dog and a ball - is there a more natural way to envoke graceful action imagery? A terrific capture, it is full of intensity, color and detail. Some may see the slight blur on the body as a negative, but it only enhances the detail of the dog''s face as it concentrates on the ball. A wonderful capture and worth every point of it''s rating. A technical and artistic success, just shy of being perfect. Well done.</td>', 'A dog and a ball - is there a more natural way to envoke graceful action imagery? A terrific capture, it is full of intensity, color and detail. Some may see the slight blur on the body as a negative, but it only enhances the detail of the dog''s face as it concentrates on the ball. A wonderful capture and worth every point of it''s rating. A technical and artistic success, just shy of being perfect. Well done.', '2009-04-28 12:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455537, 784866, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue along with a very slightly over done sharpening. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue along with a very slightly over done sharpening. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455538, 785585, 101256, '<td valign="top">Is there a more natural way to envoke graceful action imagery? A terrific capture, it is full of intensity, color and detail. Some may see the slight blur on the body as a negative, but it only enhances the detail of the dog''s face as it concentrates. A wonderful capture and worth every point of it''s rating. A technical and artistic success.</td>', 'Is there a more natural way to envoke graceful action imagery? A terrific capture, it is full of intensity, color and detail. Some may see the slight blur on the body as a negative, but it only enhances the detail of the dog''s face as it concentrates. A wonderful capture and worth every point of it''s rating. A technical and artistic success.', '2009-04-28 12:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455540, 784868, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good image of a humming bird in motion, it is a little less detailed than it should be given the very interesting colors of the pin feathers. Properly framed, the emphasis on the bird rather than the feeder is an excellant example of framing and composition. Not quite the artistic success it could have been - a little more time and patience in capturing these elusive birds would have helped. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very good image of a humming bird in motion, it is a little less detailed than it should be given the very interesting colors of the pin feathers. Properly framed, the emphasis on the bird rather than the feeder is an excellant example of framing and composition. Not quite the artistic success it could have been - a little more time and patience in capturing these elusive birds would have helped. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455541, 785579, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other insect images, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring in addition to the soft focus which is ineffective. The distance involved leads to lack of detail which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other insect images, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring in addition to the soft focus which is ineffective. The distance involved leads to lack of detail which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455545, 785294, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant motion shot rich in detail with excellant light and shadow control. The whites are right on the edge of being over exposed which is a plus and adds to the dynamic impression. The little water droplets are a bit of a distraction, but those are always difficult to control in this situation. A worthy entry into the challenge. Rerated from an initial 8 to a 9. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant motion shot rich in detail with excellant light and shadow control. The whites are right on the edge of being over exposed which is a plus and adds to the dynamic impression. The little water droplets are a bit of a distraction, but those are always difficult to control in this situation. A worthy entry into the challenge. Rerated from an initial 8 to a 9. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455546, 785524, 101256, '<td valign="top">Something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose of the pup running. A complete technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose of the pup running. A complete technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455547, 785586, 101256, '<td valign="top">An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose perfectly captured. A complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the vaguely detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose perfectly captured. A complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455548, 785191, 101256, '<td valign="top">An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose. An amazing image perfectly captured. It is a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'An amazing viewpoint and something that one doesn''t often see - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better crop, the detailed background compliments the intensity and meaningful purpose. An amazing image perfectly captured. It is a complete technical and artistic success. Should be a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455550, 785256, 101256, '<td valign="top">While nicely detailed, the blank background doesn''t quite work as well as it should have give the dark nature of the subject. Technically competant, it fails to offer the viewer anything to examine closer and elicit some interest. A little added object or something similar to give the viewer some context would have been a plus. Not a complete or artistic success, it is a competant image and a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'While nicely detailed, the blank background doesn''t quite work as well as it should have give the dark nature of the subject. Technically competant, it fails to offer the viewer anything to examine closer and elicit some interest. A little added object or something similar to give the viewer some context would have been a plus. Not a complete or artistic success, it is a competant image and a good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455551, 785368, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring is the major issue. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455552, 785417, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image, although it would do with a little more cropping on the right - that would be a personal choice however and as it is, it''s wonderful. Beauty, grace and style in a capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image, although it would do with a little more cropping on the right - that would be a personal choice however and as it is, it''s wonderful. Beauty, grace and style in a capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455553, 785510, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blur give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.</td>', 'Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blur give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.', '2009-04-28 13:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455554, 785475, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blue give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.</td>', 'Abstract in it''s execution, there are two ways to view this image - negatively in the sense that it''s undetailed and in no way, from a strict interpretation standpoint, indicates motion or the effects of motion. On the other hand, it''s very abstract nature is indicative of motion and the colors and motion blue give it a certain feel, as it related to the challenge subject, that is a plus. In this kind of quandry, and given this reviewer''s propensity to positively rate abstract images, the benefit of the doubt goes to the author. The blend of color and background are complimentary which is an artistic plus and can be viewed as a technical plus. Not necessarily to everyone''s taste, this might break into the top twenty and possibly the top fifteen images if the commenters and reviewers give it chance by understanding the nature of impressionist imagery.', '2009-04-28 13:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455558, 784522, 101256, '<td valign="top">Initially, this image failed to completely impress, but on a third viewing, it would appear that the initial impression was incorrect. This is one of those images that require more than one view to properly assess because of it''s very nature - a macro shot with a rather plain background and lack of motion inviting closer inspection. However on review, the details pop out - nice and rich with excellant exposure and color control. There are not any technical issues and while it failed to impress initially, it is a complete artistic success. Originally rated an 8, it it rerated a 9. Well done.</td>', 'Initially, this image failed to completely impress, but on a third viewing, it would appear that the initial impression was incorrect. This is one of those images that require more than one view to properly assess because of it''s very nature - a macro shot with a rather plain background and lack of motion inviting closer inspection. However on review, the details pop out - nice and rich with excellant exposure and color control. There are not any technical issues and while it failed to impress initially, it is a complete artistic success. Originally rated an 8, it it rerated a 9. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455559, 785553, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more exposure control would have made this image a potential top ten contender if not a ribbon. A great action/motion shot, it appears to be a little flat and duller than it should be. No technical issues to mention, the artistic success is also affected negatively by the flat color. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A little more exposure control would have made this image a potential top ten contender if not a ribbon. A great action/motion shot, it appears to be a little flat and duller than it should be. No technical issues to mention, the artistic success is also affected negatively by the flat color. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455560, 785522, 101256, '<td valign="top">Eadweard Muybridge in 1872 settled a bet on whether a horse ever has all four feet off the ground at the same time. This is a perfect example of that which is still argued today. A richly detailed and dramatic image, this demonstrates the beauty, grace and style of a running horse in the Sport of Kings. Unfortunately, the image appears to be over saturated and over sharpened - the author would have done well to turn down the color intensity and allowed the image to speak for itself without sharpening. A worthy entry into the challenge, a little less post processing would have made this a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner.</td>', 'Eadweard Muybridge in 1872 settled a bet on whether a horse ever has all four feet off the ground at the same time. This is a perfect example of that which is still argued today. A richly detailed and dramatic image, this demonstrates the beauty, grace and style of a running horse in the Sport of Kings. Unfortunately, the image appears to be over saturated and over sharpened - the author would have done well to turn down the color intensity and allowed the image to speak for itself without sharpening. A worthy entry into the challenge, a little less post processing would have made this a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner.', '2009-04-28 13:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455561, 785123, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being over sharpened in addition to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the over sharpening stand out (as evidenced by the slight halo surrounding the bird). A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being over sharpened in addition to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the over sharpening stand out (as evidenced by the slight halo surrounding the bird). A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455562, 785083, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.</td>', 'Another highly detailed and technically perfect image. Beauty, grace and style in a motion capture that would is the envy of many photographers. An image suitable for Aududon in any format. Well done.', '2009-04-28 13:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
