(5455571, 785548, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. While properly focused with good detail this did not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. While properly focused with good detail this did not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455576, 785469, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to over done whites which over power the incredible action in this image. While properly focused with good detail this technical flaw did not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to over done whites which over power the incredible action in this image. While properly focused with good detail this technical flaw did not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455577, 785525, 101256, '<td valign="top">Woulda, coulda, shoulda - the rich detail and excellant capture of the mallard is lost in the white and busy background. Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. The distance involved leads to lack of perspective which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Woulda, coulda, shoulda - the rich detail and excellant capture of the mallard is lost in the white and busy background. Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. The distance involved leads to lack of perspective which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455578, 785492, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting. The rather large space detracts from the subject significantly.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting. The rather large space detracts from the subject significantly.', '2009-04-28 13:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
