(5455851, 785575, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s better to just shut up and vote. A beautiful image that, on first review seemed a little over done, but on the comment pass, it just jumped out and said howdy. The whites are a little over done and it might suit the image to revisit it and tone map the whites to a more neutral level. This is a minor nit pick however - the rest of the image is rich in detail and has some significant interest and pop. Originally rated a 7, it''s rerated as a 9. Well done - a top twenty entry.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s better to just shut up and vote. A beautiful image that, on first review seemed a little over done, but on the comment pass, it just jumped out and said howdy. The whites are a little over done and it might suit the image to revisit it and tone map the whites to a more neutral level. This is a minor nit pick however - the rest of the image is rich in detail and has some significant interest and pop. Originally rated a 7, it''s rerated as a 9. Well done - a top twenty entry.', '2009-04-28 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455881, 785054, 39110, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!', '2009-04-28 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
