(5455899, 785477, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of the owl. <br/> <br/>Only slight nitpicks are the jesses flying up (not much you can do about that) and there are a couple of odd artifcts in your shot. One centre of screen and one on the left . . which sadly (once they are noticed) pull the viewers eye away from the Owl.<br/> <br/>On the upside though - lovely bright eyes and wonderful wing position.</td>', 'Lovely capture of the owl.  Only slight nitpicks are the jesses flying up (not much you can do about that) and there are a couple of odd artifcts in your shot. One centre of screen and one on the left . . which sadly (once they are noticed) pull the viewers eye away from the Owl. On the upside though - lovely bright eyes and wonderful wing position.', '2009-04-28 17:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
