(5455979, 785430, 76843, '<td valign="top">Nice! 9</td>', 'Nice! 9', '2009-04-28 19:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455980, 785644, 76843, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! 9</td>', 'Cool shot! 9', '2009-04-28 19:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455997, 785470, 101256, '<td valign="top">Being a lover of herding dogs and owning several Border Collies, there is a certain appreciation for this kind of image. While a great image, it''s from the wrong side - most of the fun of watching sheep dogs is "the eye" that is their main tool of choice when moving sheep. Nicely detailed image and terrific color control. Originally a 7, it''s been rerated an 8 because of it''s technical success.</td>', 'Being a lover of herding dogs and owning several Border Collies, there is a certain appreciation for this kind of image. While a great image, it''s from the wrong side - most of the fun of watching sheep dogs is "the eye" that is their main tool of choice when moving sheep. Nicely detailed image and terrific color control. Originally a 7, it''s been rerated an 8 because of it''s technical success.', '2009-04-28 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5455998, 785455, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. A good action sequence, it''s view from the back isn''t quite as dramatic as it should be. A sound effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge. A good action sequence, it''s view from the back isn''t quite as dramatic as it should be. A sound effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 19:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456010, 785542, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good action image that is affected by it''s flat color and appearance. A difficult shot in any circumstances given the obvious lighting conditions. In this case it might have been a better idea to underexpose to bring out some color and use a closer focus - woulda, coulda, shoulda which is always a problem reviewing these kinds of images. Suffice to say that it is a good image from a technical standpoint, just lacking in artistic impact. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very good action image that is affected by it''s flat color and appearance. A difficult shot in any circumstances given the obvious lighting conditions. In this case it might have been a better idea to underexpose to bring out some color and use a closer focus - woulda, coulda, shoulda which is always a problem reviewing these kinds of images. Suffice to say that it is a good image from a technical standpoint, just lacking in artistic impact. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456011, 785549, 101256, '<td valign="top">Effective motion control and good color. The action is obvious and the detail in the focused area is very good. The image could do with a crop of about the top third of the image to create a more dynamic image - try it with your browser slider and see if you agree. Overall a good solid effort just falling short of being excellant.</td>', 'Effective motion control and good color. The action is obvious and the detail in the focused area is very good. The image could do with a crop of about the top third of the image to create a more dynamic image - try it with your browser slider and see if you agree. Overall a good solid effort just falling short of being excellant.', '2009-04-28 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456012, 785540, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring in addition to the soft focus which is ineffective. The distance involved leads to lack of detail which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring in addition to the soft focus which is ineffective. The distance involved leads to lack of detail which does not help the image at all. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 20:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456014, 785518, 88247, '<td valign="top">I just love these two little cuties:-) They seem great pals and look like they are having so much fun.<br/>Btw,still not biased,it''s a great shot:-)</td>', 'I just love these two little cuties:-) They seem great pals and look like they are having so much fun.Btw,still not biased,it''s a great shot:-)', '2009-04-28 20:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456015, 785480, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are some aspects of this image which are very effective - the vaguely detailed background and linear motion foreground is very intriguing. Unfortunaely, the motion blur isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint and a little more motion control focusing on the subject would have been a huge plus - racoons are a great subject with great color detail and that certain comedic look about them. Still a good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'There are some aspects of this image which are very effective - the vaguely detailed background and linear motion foreground is very intriguing. Unfortunaely, the motion blur isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint and a little more motion control focusing on the subject would have been a huge plus - racoons are a great subject with great color detail and that certain comedic look about them. Still a good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 20:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456017, 784734, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid effort that suffers from too much space to be truly effective. The unfortunate and obviously difficult lighting conditions didn''t help any either. A crop of the mountains would have helped, but then the whole concept of the title would be lost.  A little different angle on the shot along with a little tighter focus on the antelope would have been a plus, but depending on the lens used, impossible to achieve. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid effort that suffers from too much space to be truly effective. The unfortunate and obviously difficult lighting conditions didn''t help any either. A crop of the mountains would have helped, but then the whole concept of the title would be lost.  A little different angle on the shot along with a little tighter focus on the antelope would have been a plus, but depending on the lens used, impossible to achieve. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456019, 784654, 88247, '<td valign="top">Great shot.<br/>Makes me wonder what he is focusing on with that stare/glare.</td>', 'Great shot.Makes me wonder what he is focusing on with that stare/glare.', '2009-04-28 20:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456021, 785127, 101256, '<td valign="top">Extreme lighting conditions meant that a better approach might have been to reduce the exposure by either aperature or shutter speed - the image appears to be washed out. It might have been a good choice to reduce the exposure and increase the color saturation using basic editing tools to increase the visual impact of this image. The subject is richly detailed which is washed out - it would have been a very good image if only a little more exposure control was used. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Extreme lighting conditions meant that a better approach might have been to reduce the exposure by either aperature or shutter speed - the image appears to be washed out. It might have been a good choice to reduce the exposure and increase the color saturation using basic editing tools to increase the visual impact of this image. The subject is richly detailed which is washed out - it would have been a very good image if only a little more exposure control was used. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 20:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456022, 785031, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in that the focus is much too soft and the difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the exposure faults stand out. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting or alternatively reducing shutter speed or aperature while manually focusing.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in that the focus is much too soft and the difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the exposure faults stand out. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting or alternatively reducing shutter speed or aperature while manually focusing.', '2009-04-28 20:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456026, 784465, 101256, '<td valign="top">On first review, this image came across as a little under exposed, but on comment review, it would appear that it is perfectly exposed with a couple of minor issues with over done highlights. A good solid action shot that exposing the myth of hippos being jolly animals with good dispositions. A worthy entry into the challenge. A suggestion for the future would be to use a little more light control and go with area metering rather than spot metering which is usually the problem with an image that has highlights like this.</td>', 'On first review, this image came across as a little under exposed, but on comment review, it would appear that it is perfectly exposed with a couple of minor issues with over done highlights. A good solid action shot that exposing the myth of hippos being jolly animals with good dispositions. A worthy entry into the challenge. A suggestion for the future would be to use a little more light control and go with area metering rather than spot metering which is usually the problem with an image that has highlights like this.', '2009-04-28 20:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456032, 785584, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring and lack of detail in the bird. The image is too tall to be effective and while the author has matched the title to the image, it just falls short of being truly effective in the artistic sense. Images like this are always difficult and the author has done well capturing a spur of the moment image. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways due to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring and lack of detail in the bird. The image is too tall to be effective and while the author has matched the title to the image, it just falls short of being truly effective in the artistic sense. Images like this are always difficult and the author has done well capturing a spur of the moment image. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 20:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456042, 785442, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are some aspects of this image which are very effective - the vaguely detailed background and linear motion foreground is very intriguing. Unfortunaely, the motion blur isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint and a little more motion control focusing on the subject would have been a huge plus - a great subject with great color detail that is lost in the motion. Still a good solid entry into the challenge</td>', 'There are some aspects of this image which are very effective - the vaguely detailed background and linear motion foreground is very intriguing. Unfortunaely, the motion blur isn''t as effective from an artistic standpoint and a little more motion control focusing on the subject would have been a huge plus - a great subject with great color detail that is lost in the motion. Still a good solid entry into the challenge', '2009-04-28 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456044, 785583, 101256, '<td valign="top">Audubon perfect, this is an amazing image richly detailed, properly framed and composed with nothing out of place and technically perfect. It has a great deal of artistic impact and is as stunningly beautiful the third or fourth viewing as it was on the first. A complete artistic and technical success demonstrating motion, grace, and beauty. Well done. Originally rated a 7, this was a mistake on the part of the reviewer because of a faulty initial impression. A 10 is in order.</td>', 'Audubon perfect, this is an amazing image richly detailed, properly framed and composed with nothing out of place and technically perfect. It has a great deal of artistic impact and is as stunningly beautiful the third or fourth viewing as it was on the first. A complete artistic and technical success demonstrating motion, grace, and beauty. Well done. Originally rated a 7, this was a mistake on the part of the reviewer because of a faulty initial impression. A 10 is in order.', '2009-04-28 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456049, 784885, 101256, '<td valign="top">Something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better composition, the vaguely detailed background compliments subjest. An good image perfectly captured. While technically a solid image, it lacks substantive artistic impact. Still, a worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Something that one doesn''t often see with black dogs - rich and detailed facial expressions. While the image could use a little better composition, the vaguely detailed background compliments subjest. An good image perfectly captured. While technically a solid image, it lacks substantive artistic impact. Still, a worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456179, 785128, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting angle. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting angle. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.', '2009-04-28 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456180, 784994, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting angle. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting angle. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.', '2009-04-28 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456183, 785220, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting, but more likely the result of the dark and gray. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and action component. Having said that, it just appears to be uninteresting in an artistic sense.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure that just seems a little flat which may be the result of the lighting, but more likely the result of the dark and gray. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and action component. Having said that, it just appears to be uninteresting in an artistic sense.', '2009-04-28 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456186, 785526, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure and clever conversion with the rich color tones of the dog contrasting with the grayscale background.. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure and clever conversion with the rich color tones of the dog contrasting with the grayscale background.. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail and a terrific action component.', '2009-04-28 23:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456188, 784938, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure resulting in excellant color. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail in general and outstanding color and detail on the lead horse. A good stop motion capture. Originally rated a 7 on initial review, this had been rerated to an 8 for artistic effect. Well done.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure resulting in excellant color. A worthy entry into the challenge with good detail in general and outstanding color and detail on the lead horse. A good stop motion capture. Originally rated a 7 on initial review, this had been rerated to an 8 for artistic effect. Well done.', '2009-04-28 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456191, 784713, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very amusing photograph that falls short of being perfect. A little longer look would have helped along wtih a brighter exposure. Still, a very interesting image with a good humor component. Well done.</td>', 'A very amusing photograph that falls short of being perfect. A little longer look would have helped along wtih a brighter exposure. Still, a very interesting image with a good humor component. Well done.', '2009-04-28 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456192, 784657, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure with the rich color tones. Not particularly a motion shot, it is a good macro that could use a little more focus and a little heavier hand on the exposure. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good action shot rich in detail with plenty to look at. A good exposure with the rich color tones. Not particularly a motion shot, it is a good macro that could use a little more focus and a little heavier hand on the exposure. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456193, 785451, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image of a pouncing cat and, from a technical standpoint, a terrific conversion. Rich in detail, a little more tracking on the motion would have brought out more detail and given the image a little more impact from an artistic standpoint. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image of a pouncing cat and, from a technical standpoint, a terrific conversion. Rich in detail, a little more tracking on the motion would have brought out more detail and given the image a little more impact from an artistic standpoint. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 23:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456194, 785345, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image of a curious pup. From a technical standpoint, it''s not a great image because of the lens/motion blur and the very slight oversharpening of the dog. A little more camera control along with some motion control would have brought out more detail and given the image a little more impact from an artistic standpoint. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image of a curious pup. From a technical standpoint, it''s not a great image because of the lens/motion blur and the very slight oversharpening of the dog. A little more camera control along with some motion control would have brought out more detail and given the image a little more impact from an artistic standpoint. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456199, 785497, 101256, '<td valign="top">The initial rating of 6 on this image was mistaken. On first review, it appeared to be a riot of color without a lot of definition, but on review, the fish just jumps out of the background - it takes a while to see it which is a bit of a problem, but the detail is there - the problem lies in the overly color busy background. A little more bokeh would have helped the eye differentiate between the fish and background. A good entry into the challenge, it''s been rerated an 8. Well done.</td>', 'The initial rating of 6 on this image was mistaken. On first review, it appeared to be a riot of color without a lot of definition, but on review, the fish just jumps out of the background - it takes a while to see it which is a bit of a problem, but the detail is there - the problem lies in the overly color busy background. A little more bokeh would have helped the eye differentiate between the fish and background. A good entry into the challenge, it''s been rerated an 8. Well done.', '2009-04-28 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456200, 784871, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being under focused in addition to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the focus problem stand out. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being under focused in addition to a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank sky also enhances these two problems and makes the focus problem stand out. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-28 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456203, 785319, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good action shot that falls just short of being a technical success. A difficult lighting problem with the flatish green background in combination with a odd lighting angle. Some of the body details are lost in dark while others aren''t apparent at all. A good entry into the challenge that falls just short of being a technical and artistic success.</td>', 'A very good action shot that falls just short of being a technical success. A difficult lighting problem with the flatish green background in combination with a odd lighting angle. Some of the body details are lost in dark while others aren''t apparent at all. A good entry into the challenge that falls just short of being a technical and artistic success.', '2009-04-28 23:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456205, 785552, 101256, '<td valign="top">Originally rated a 6, this has been rerated 8 - it is a purely poetic motion capture with a great deal of artistic impact. Not perfect technically, the artistic component overwhelms any technical issues - poetry in motion, this is a very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Originally rated a 6, this has been rerated 8 - it is a purely poetic motion capture with a great deal of artistic impact. Not perfect technically, the artistic component overwhelms any technical issues - poetry in motion, this is a very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-28 23:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
