(5457570, 785476, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love those birds so much.  It amazes me how they will be waddling around you one minute, then transform into such majestic beauty when they spread their wings to fly.  This one is captured so beautifully!</td>', 'I love those birds so much.  It amazes me how they will be waddling around you one minute, then transform into such majestic beauty when they spread their wings to fly.  This one is captured so beautifully!', '2009-04-29 14:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
