(5457804, 785293, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is great. The sharp focus and excellent eye contact works well...<br/>I really wish that you had cropped a little tighter and/or cloned out the distracting yellow item in the background which slightly ruins a top shot for me... best of luck. <br/> <br/>I''d expect to see this in the top 10...</td>', 'This is great. The sharp focus and excellent eye contact works well...I really wish that you had cropped a little tighter and/or cloned out the distracting yellow item in the background which slightly ruins a top shot for me... best of luck.  I''d expect to see this in the top 10...', '2009-04-29 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457828, 785590, 103032, '<td valign="top">This one strikes me as the best of the bunch.  Obviously meets the challenge.  The composition is great, the entire image is nicely focused.  What I like is how you post processed it to colorize the number 3 horse to keep that horse and rider the subject of the image.   The viewer is drawn into the story that is told by the image, great context.  Great pic. 10</td>', 'This one strikes me as the best of the bunch.  Obviously meets the challenge.  The composition is great, the entire image is nicely focused.  What I like is how you post processed it to colorize the number 3 horse to keep that horse and rider the subject of the image.   The viewer is drawn into the story that is told by the image, great context.  Great pic. 10', '2009-04-29 17:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457842, 785054, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this image for the abstract quality.  Nice use of slow shutter to blur the birds to show motion, but what I like is that the background is totally blurred, giving that abstract feel.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like this image for the abstract quality.  Nice use of slow shutter to blur the birds to show motion, but what I like is that the background is totally blurred, giving that abstract feel.  Nice job.', '2009-04-29 17:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457847, 785510, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the total blur for the abstract quality.</td>', 'I like the total blur for the abstract quality.', '2009-04-29 17:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457858, 785088, 103032, '<td valign="top">Comparing similar dog images, I like this one the best.  I like that the dog is well focused, and that you did catch him mid stride.  The beach setting doesn''t distract at all compared to the other dog shots, it provides a nice backdrop where the dog "pops" out in the photo.  Nice DOF in blurring out the grasses in the background.  This is a great shot.</td>', 'Comparing similar dog images, I like this one the best.  I like that the dog is well focused, and that you did catch him mid stride.  The beach setting doesn''t distract at all compared to the other dog shots, it provides a nice backdrop where the dog "pops" out in the photo.  Nice DOF in blurring out the grasses in the background.  This is a great shot.', '2009-04-29 17:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457872, 785120, 70173, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2009-04-29 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457879, 785293, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Terrific perspective for the weave poles and picture-perfect DOF and detail.</td>', 'Love this!  Terrific perspective for the weave poles and picture-perfect DOF and detail.', '2009-04-29 18:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457881, 785485, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dang bluebirds are too photogenic by far!  Fantastic pose, lighting and complementary background.  Might bump the contrast just a touch and sharpen the head more.  But this is a stunning shot; I wouldn''t be surprised to see it ribbon.</td>', 'Dang bluebirds are too photogenic by far!  Fantastic pose, lighting and complementary background.  Might bump the contrast just a touch and sharpen the head more.  But this is a stunning shot; I wouldn''t be surprised to see it ribbon.', '2009-04-29 18:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457882, 784926, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail on the birds; love the pose on the landing bird and the composition.  Quite a poetic title, too ;-)  Personally I would prefer some context to the background, but all in all a really great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful detail on the birds; love the pose on the landing bird and the composition.  Quite a poetic title, too ;-)  Personally I would prefer some context to the background, but all in all a really great shot.', '2009-04-29 18:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457883, 784061, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I love the outstretched claws.  The cat looks athletic and graceful and quite lovely.</td>', 'Great composition and I love the outstretched claws.  The cat looks athletic and graceful and quite lovely.', '2009-04-29 18:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457884, 784654, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love those intense, HUGE, very yellow eyes!  Motion in the wings is a perfect complement to the sharp expression.</td>', 'Love those intense, HUGE, very yellow eyes!  Motion in the wings is a perfect complement to the sharp expression.', '2009-04-29 18:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457885, 785559, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of motion and a very proud pup!</td>', 'Lots of motion and a very proud pup!', '2009-04-29 18:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
