(5457892, 785265, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mid-air capture.  That dog really flies high!  S/he could use a little more headroom in the composition, I think.</td>', 'Beautiful mid-air capture.  That dog really flies high!  S/he could use a little more headroom in the composition, I think.', '2009-04-29 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457893, 785531, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and color on the heron.  Background looks somewhat more uniform in color than I would expect, but it does make a nice foil for the bird.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and color on the heron.  Background looks somewhat more uniform in color than I would expect, but it does make a nice foil for the bird.', '2009-04-29 18:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457894, 785480, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like this; very photogenic log he picked to run along.  I ordinarily want more sharpness on the subject but for this challenge I think the focus/blur works well, and I can see a catchlight in his eye which adds expression to him.</td>', 'I like this; very photogenic log he picked to run along.  I ordinarily want more sharpness on the subject but for this challenge I think the focus/blur works well, and I can see a catchlight in his eye which adds expression to him.', '2009-04-29 18:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457897, 785457, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good concept; "nice" doesn''t seem appropriate here ;-)  Both subjects are well-positioned.  Think I would crop much tighter on the bottom to really zero in on the cat and the wheel; the stand doesn''t add anything, and the tighter crop would turn the legs of the stand into strong leading lines.</td>', 'Good concept; "nice" doesn''t seem appropriate here ;-)  Both subjects are well-positioned.  Think I would crop much tighter on the bottom to really zero in on the cat and the wheel; the stand doesn''t add anything, and the tighter crop would turn the legs of the stand into strong leading lines.', '2009-04-29 18:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457899, 784678, 65234, '<td valign="top">I agree!  Don''t think I''ve ever gotten one without motion blur; ths guy looks like he''s perched on an invisible leaf.</td>', 'I agree!  Don''t think I''ve ever gotten one without motion blur; ths guy looks like he''s perched on an invisible leaf.', '2009-04-29 18:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457900, 784874, 65234, '<td valign="top">My yard is full of these little guys, hovering near their nests in my fence.  Nice balance of detail and motion blur.</td>', 'My yard is full of these little guys, hovering near their nests in my fence.  Nice balance of detail and motion blur.', '2009-04-29 18:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
