(5458230, 785220, 98771, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, good decision to go with the b&amp;w.</td>', 'This is really nice, good decision to go with the b&w.', '2009-04-29 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458233, 785581, 98771, '<td valign="top">Another great image, this challenge is full of them. It does have a definite free fall feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'Another great image, this challenge is full of them. It does have a definite free fall feel to it. Well done.', '2009-04-29 23:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458234, 785508, 98771, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image, well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image, well done.', '2009-04-29 23:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458237, 785537, 98771, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing a tough subject. Very sharp.</td>', 'Nice job capturing a tough subject. Very sharp.', '2009-04-29 23:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458264, 785259, 96881, '<td valign="top">Goo depth of field on this to remove all elements from the background.  I however are not a fan of the crop at the top, where you have cut the risers head off.......<br/> <br/>With this subject, having the horse in full motion, the tail streaming behind and the Riders Red hair also streaming behind would have been a great look.</td>', 'Goo depth of field on this to remove all elements from the background.  I however are not a fan of the crop at the top, where you have cut the risers head off....... With this subject, having the horse in full motion, the tail streaming behind and the Riders Red hair also streaming behind would have been a great look.', '2009-04-29 23:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458265, 784540, 96881, '<td valign="top">The branch in the photo is a distraction.  I like your shutter speed, getting the head sharp but the wings slightly blurred, however being slightly in front of the bird would have helped, as then the large blur of the wings would no longer be the focal point</td>', 'The branch in the photo is a distraction.  I like your shutter speed, getting the head sharp but the wings slightly blurred, however being slightly in front of the bird would have helped, as then the large blur of the wings would no longer be the focal point', '2009-04-29 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458267, 785547, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  You have managed to stop the bird dead and sharp.  I would have cropped close on this.  I normally love the negative space(and use it), but with the different colours in your bqackground, it becomes a distraction.  The DOF is good to try and eliminate them, but the large brown fence across the image doesn''t help it</td>', 'Great capture.  You have managed to stop the bird dead and sharp.  I would have cropped close on this.  I normally love the negative space(and use it), but with the different colours in your bqackground, it becomes a distraction.  The DOF is good to try and eliminate them, but the large brown fence across the image doesn''t help it', '2009-04-29 23:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458270, 785508, 96881, '<td valign="top">Love the capture of this.  However I feel the bird is a little constrained by the crop.  Some additional space around it would have helped balance the shot, and given it somewhere to ''fly'' to</td>', 'Love the capture of this.  However I feel the bird is a little constrained by the crop.  Some additional space around it would have helped balance the shot, and given it somewhere to ''fly'' to', '2009-04-29 23:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458271, 785476, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, a shame that it woasn''t captured slightly later against the cloudy sky instead of being in front of that large tree</td>', 'Nice photo, a shame that it woasn''t captured slightly later against the cloudy sky instead of being in front of that large tree', '2009-04-29 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458275, 785345, 96881, '<td valign="top">There is something about this photo that haes just made my eyes go weird.  I think it is the out of focus trees that is just at the range that my eyes are trying to focus it.  Very disturbing.  Hard to comment the photo when I have to do it in 2 sec looks.<br/> <br/>Nice idea and composition.  But the focus makes it hard for me to look at it.........Just commenting, not voting anyway</td>', 'There is something about this photo that haes just made my eyes go weird.  I think it is the out of focus trees that is just at the range that my eyes are trying to focus it.  Very disturbing.  Hard to comment the photo when I have to do it in 2 sec looks. Nice idea and composition.  But the focus makes it hard for me to look at it.........Just commenting, not voting anyway', '2009-04-29 23:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458278, 785464, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and clever composition.  Great DOF on this.  I like how the yellow stripe on the bug matches the line on the road</td>', 'Very interesting and clever composition.  Great DOF on this.  I like how the yellow stripe on the bug matches the line on the road', '2009-04-29 23:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458288, 785565, 96881, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  What I wanted to see in this challenge.  An anlimal captured in full motion, and captured well.  Good DOF of this, excellent picture, nothing more to add...........</td>', 'Stunning.  What I wanted to see in this challenge.  An anlimal captured in full motion, and captured well.  Good DOF of this, excellent picture, nothing more to add...........', '2009-04-29 23:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458290, 784874, 96881, '<td valign="top">As I am allergic to bees, I have a hatred of them........fortunately I am only commenting, and not voting on the images.<br/> <br/>Very shallow DOF on this, which has worked well, however it would have been so much beter if the bee was flying towards you</td>', 'As I am allergic to bees, I have a hatred of them........fortunately I am only commenting, and not voting on the images. Very shallow DOF on this, which has worked well, however it would have been so much beter if the bee was flying towards you', '2009-04-29 23:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458292, 785527, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good processing, like the border added as well as it compliments the photo.  Crop is spot on</td>', 'Nice capture, good processing, like the border added as well as it compliments the photo.  Crop is spot on', '2009-04-29 23:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458296, 785584, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, but cropping off the feet doesn''t help.  Also would have had it more to the right, so that it was ascending to the top left corner of the image</td>', 'Nice Idea, but cropping off the feet doesn''t help.  Also would have had it more to the right, so that it was ascending to the top left corner of the image', '2009-04-30 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458298, 785430, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the bird, but the stark white background doesn''t work for me.  I would prefer to see cloudy sky or something, and not flat white</td>', 'Great capture of the bird, but the stark white background doesn''t work for me.  I would prefer to see cloudy sky or something, and not flat white', '2009-04-30 00:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458300, 784908, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and a balanced composition for this.  Crop is good and the tree in the bottom works for me</td>', 'Nice capture and a balanced composition for this.  Crop is good and the tree in the bottom works for me', '2009-04-30 00:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458303, 785120, 96881, '<td valign="top">Remembering times many years ago.  A friend had a couple of these when I was growing up.  Big, graceful animals.  We used to take the cart out with them pulling it along the road..............good times<br/> <br/>Greta phoot, I love the processing for this, it just appeals to me.  Well done</td>', 'Remembering times many years ago.  A friend had a couple of these when I was growing up.  Big, graceful animals.  We used to take the cart out with them pulling it along the road..............good times Greta phoot, I love the processing for this, it just appeals to me.  Well done', '2009-04-30 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458305, 784959, 96881, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why it needed to be validated.  I just think you are way too patient to be able to capture this against that brilliant sky.  Major issue though is the size, would have loved the subject to be bigger, but that may not have been possible</td>', 'Don''t know why it needed to be validated.  I just think you are way too patient to be able to capture this against that brilliant sky.  Major issue though is the size, would have loved the subject to be bigger, but that may not have been possible', '2009-04-30 00:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458309, 785513, 96881, '<td valign="top">It is probably the effect you were after, the old school type, but I am not a fan of the processing, and the noise that it creates, the lack of contrast and definition in the subject as it gets lost amoung the background.</td>', 'It is probably the effect you were after, the old school type, but I am not a fan of the processing, and the noise that it creates, the lack of contrast and definition in the subject as it gets lost amoung the background.', '2009-04-30 00:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458310, 784770, 96881, '<td valign="top">A shame that the second dog was cropped out partly fgrom the photo. I just want to see a little bot more on that side............</td>', 'A shame that the second dog was cropped out partly fgrom the photo. I just want to see a little bot more on that side............', '2009-04-30 00:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458325, 785548, 47487, '<td valign="top">I love the detail on his wings. A slightly tighter crop might have been just a tiny bit better, IMO, but this is a really nice image.</td>', 'I love the detail on his wings. A slightly tighter crop might have been just a tiny bit better, IMO, but this is a really nice image.', '2009-04-30 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458327, 785486, 47487, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I was hoping for a little less talk and a lot more action. ;-) (Clever shot, though, and a really interesting use of selective desat.)</td>', 'Cute, but I was hoping for a little less talk and a lot more action. ;-) (Clever shot, though, and a really interesting use of selective desat.)', '2009-04-30 00:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458329, 784678, 47487, '<td valign="top">YOU ARE NOT KIDDING. Great job! Really nice image. If I were going to crop it I might get rid of some of the negative space at the top, but that''s just me. Again, great job.</td>', 'YOU ARE NOT KIDDING. Great job! Really nice image. If I were going to crop it I might get rid of some of the negative space at the top, but that''s just me. Again, great job.', '2009-04-30 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458330, 785585, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a darling expression, well-captured! :)</td>', 'What a darling expression, well-captured! :)', '2009-04-30 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458396, 785503, 106433, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Strong work.</td>', 'Stunning. Strong work.', '2009-04-30 02:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458422, 785088, 105399, '<td valign="top">Very Cute, nice clear picture.</td>', 'Very Cute, nice clear picture.', '2009-04-30 03:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458423, 784959, 105399, '<td valign="top">Cool butterfly, but it would be nice if it was zoomed in a little closer.</td>', 'Cool butterfly, but it would be nice if it was zoomed in a little closer.', '2009-04-30 03:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458424, 785586, 105399, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Good clear shot of the dog :)</td>', 'Fun shot. Good clear shot of the dog :)', '2009-04-30 03:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458437, 785442, 98349, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the blur doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I like the idea but the blur doesn''t work for me.', '2009-04-30 04:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458442, 785589, 79955, '<td valign="top">Wish the central twig / branch was not there. The tones are nice in this shot , 6</td>', 'Wish the central twig / branch was not there. The tones are nice in this shot , 6', '2009-04-30 05:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458443, 785084, 79955, '<td valign="top">nice capture , well composed 7</td>', 'nice capture , well composed 7', '2009-04-30 05:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458444, 785265, 79955, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!!! Wish there was just a little more punch in the colors, 9</td>', 'Wonderful capture!!! Wish there was just a little more punch in the colors, 9', '2009-04-30 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458471, 785499, 67258, '<td valign="top">Back to bump this up from  the initial harsh 2 that I gave it on first viewing.  Catching these birds in flight is incredibly difficult, and that you have succeeded at all is good.  That said, I suspect you would have been better not to crop in so tight, and to have the bird smaller in the frame - that would have had two benefits, it would appear sharper and so attention wouldn''t be drawn to the focus, and it would give a bit more context and appear more ''natural''.</td>', 'Back to bump this up from  the initial harsh 2 that I gave it on first viewing.  Catching these birds in flight is incredibly difficult, and that you have succeeded at all is good.  That said, I suspect you would have been better not to crop in so tight, and to have the bird smaller in the frame - that would have had two benefits, it would appear sharper and so attention wouldn''t be drawn to the focus, and it would give a bit more context and appear more ''natural''.', '2009-04-30 06:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458474, 785485, 67258, '<td valign="top">This really is balletic - lovely, although a little less noise on the bird (there is also the hint of a ''selection'' line above the bird''s back), and this would have been a 10 from me. As it stands, a solid 8.<br/>Edit - and now bumping to 9!</td>', 'This really is balletic - lovely, although a little less noise on the bird (there is also the hint of a ''selection'' line above the bird''s back), and this would have been a 10 from me. As it stands, a solid 8.Edit - and now bumping to 9!', '2009-04-30 06:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458478, 785503, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good timing - nice capture! The drops of water make all the difference here.</td>', 'Good timing - nice capture! The drops of water make all the difference here.', '2009-04-30 06:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458479, 785510, 67258, '<td valign="top">A truly lovely abstract image.</td>', 'A truly lovely abstract image.', '2009-04-30 06:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458481, 784959, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love that you have kept the butterfly small in the frame, a really pleasing photo.</td>', 'I love that you have kept the butterfly small in the frame, a really pleasing photo.', '2009-04-30 06:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458482, 785527, 67258, '<td valign="top">Strong stop-action shot - the tension is palpable.  Your choice of border compliments the photo well, adding to the sense of speed and forward movement.</td>', 'Strong stop-action shot - the tension is palpable.  Your choice of border compliments the photo well, adding to the sense of speed and forward movement.', '2009-04-30 06:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458483, 785256, 67258, '<td valign="top">This image is fascinating, bizarre, strange all at the same time. The pose of the cat looks almost human like, and the tail seems somehow out of place - it all makes for a rather clever photo.<br/><i> <br/>Edit - spelling-ouch!</i></td>', 'This image is fascinating, bizarre, strange all at the same time. The pose of the cat looks almost human like, and the tail seems somehow out of place - it all makes for a rather clever photo. Edit - spelling-ouch!', '2009-04-30 06:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458485, 785497, 67258, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=785497#</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=785497#', '2009-04-30 06:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458486, 784866, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely soft image, with a very pleasing muted colour palette.  i might have liked just a little more texture on the plumage on the front of the humming bird.</td>', 'A lovely soft image, with a very pleasing muted colour palette.  i might have liked just a little more texture on the plumage on the front of the humming bird.', '2009-04-30 06:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458520, 785513, 101256, '<td valign="top">The grain is effective but a more effective treatment would have been to crop the bottom as the image is too tall. The artistic impression is good, but it might have been a good idea to change from black and white to sepia or a more neutral tone. A good entry into the challenge and originally rated a 6, it has been rerated a 7 on review.</td>', 'The grain is effective but a more effective treatment would have been to crop the bottom as the image is too tall. The artistic impression is good, but it might have been a good idea to change from black and white to sepia or a more neutral tone. A good entry into the challenge and originally rated a 6, it has been rerated a 7 on review.', '2009-04-30 08:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458522, 785122, 101256, '<td valign="top">The indefinite focus in addition to the just slightly over saturated colors does not match the narrow cropping which is very effective. A good action capture marred by these two issues. A little bit more time with focusing and a little more color control in post processing would have improved this image tremendously.</td>', 'The indefinite focus in addition to the just slightly over saturated colors does not match the narrow cropping which is very effective. A good action capture marred by these two issues. A little bit more time with focusing and a little more color control in post processing would have improved this image tremendously.', '2009-04-30 08:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458523, 785537, 101256, '<td valign="top">The vaguely detailed background is a plus, but the image is overly large to be truly effective and have a really meaningful artistic impact. The bee is an excellant capture from a technical standpoint with good detail and just slightly on the edge white bloom - very effective. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The vaguely detailed background is a plus, but the image is overly large to be truly effective and have a really meaningful artistic impact. The bee is an excellant capture from a technical standpoint with good detail and just slightly on the edge white bloom - very effective. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-30 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458527, 784874, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good action capture with rich detail. The slightly over done white blooms are a negative, but this is well balanced by a very effective vaguely detailed background demonstrating the use of bokeh to increase the impact of the insect. Originally rated a 6, this has been rerated to an 8 for it''s artistic impression.</td>', 'A very good action capture with rich detail. The slightly over done white blooms are a negative, but this is well balanced by a very effective vaguely detailed background demonstrating the use of bokeh to increase the impact of the insect. Originally rated a 6, this has been rerated to an 8 for it''s artistic impression.', '2009-04-30 08:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458528, 784540, 51597, '<td valign="top">Great shot am partially to birds in flight and u captured this one very nicely...</td>', 'Great shot am partially to birds in flight and u captured this one very nicely...', '2009-04-30 08:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458529, 785586, 51597, '<td valign="top">Great capture..</td>', 'Great capture..', '2009-04-30 08:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458530, 785591, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being overly dark as a result of a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank background also enhances these two problems. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not quite to the same level of expertise as some of the other avian images in this challenge, the image is technically flawed in a couple of ways being overly dark as a result of a difficult lighting situation leading to rather flat and dull coloring. The blank background also enhances these two problems. A good effort that might have been improved with a little more patience waiting for a different angle and lighting.', '2009-04-30 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458531, 785587, 51597, '<td valign="top">Bootiful Kitty taking care of herself.. Presented nicely in the frame..</td>', 'Bootiful Kitty taking care of herself.. Presented nicely in the frame..', '2009-04-30 08:56:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5458532, 785443, 51597, '<td valign="top">Superb i love it..</td>', 'Superb i love it..', '2009-04-30 08:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458533, 785534, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite to the level of the previous koi entry, this variable focus and unfortunate light blooms on the whiter fish are distracting and negatively impact the image from both a technical and artistic standpoint. There isn''t a sense of motion which also affects it''s artistic impact.</td>', 'Not quite to the level of the previous koi entry, this variable focus and unfortunate light blooms on the whiter fish are distracting and negatively impact the image from both a technical and artistic standpoint. There isn''t a sense of motion which also affects it''s artistic impact.', '2009-04-30 08:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458534, 785557, 51597, '<td valign="top">Superb shot!! Perfect timing, deserves to Ribbon..</td>', 'Superb shot!! Perfect timing, deserves to Ribbon..', '2009-04-30 08:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458535, 785256, 51597, '<td valign="top">Terrific!!</td>', 'Terrific!!', '2009-04-30 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458537, 784608, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great capture from a technical standpoint along with the rich detail of the dog is a plus - all aspects of motion control and the perfection of the splash demonstrates proper composition and camera control. Unfortunately, the subject isn''t as interesting as it could be - the charm and attraction of dog images is usually in their expression when enjoying themselves and this obviously isn''t present in this image. Originally rated a 6, it has been rerated a 7 due to it''s technical excellance.</td>', 'A great capture from a technical standpoint along with the rich detail of the dog is a plus - all aspects of motion control and the perfection of the splash demonstrates proper composition and camera control. Unfortunately, the subject isn''t as interesting as it could be - the charm and attraction of dog images is usually in their expression when enjoying themselves and this obviously isn''t present in this image. Originally rated a 6, it has been rerated a 7 due to it''s technical excellance.', '2009-04-30 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458538, 785083, 51597, '<td valign="top">Well done!!  Terrific image!!</td>', 'Well done!!  Terrific image!!', '2009-04-30 09:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458540, 785531, 51597, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!</td>', 'Outstanding!!', '2009-04-30 09:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458541, 785107, 51597, '<td valign="top">I love it!!  Really well done and nice pp..</td>', 'I love it!!  Really well done and nice pp..', '2009-04-30 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458542, 785084, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another excellant image from a technical standpoint, the image falls short of being an artistic success. The use of bokeh to present a vaguely detailed background in addition to sound lighting and color control is a good demonstration of image construction and composition. Having said that, the image fails to impress despite it''s technical excellance. Orignially rated a 6, it has been rerated to a 8 because of the technical expertise demonstrated in this capture.</td>', 'Another excellant image from a technical standpoint, the image falls short of being an artistic success. The use of bokeh to present a vaguely detailed background in addition to sound lighting and color control is a good demonstration of image construction and composition. Having said that, the image fails to impress despite it''s technical excellance. Orignially rated a 6, it has been rerated to a 8 because of the technical expertise demonstrated in this capture.', '2009-04-30 09:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458543, 785464, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of technical aspects to this image that are spectacular. The tight focus on the subject is a plus complimented by the artistic use of DOF to create a very narrow area of detail is a huge plus. Unfortunately, there isn''t a real wow factor to the image as the subject is too small to have any significant impact - despite it''s technical excellance, it falls short of being artistically impressive. Originally rated a 6, it''s rerated to an 8 because of it''s technical competance.</td>', 'There are a lot of technical aspects to this image that are spectacular. The tight focus on the subject is a plus complimented by the artistic use of DOF to create a very narrow area of detail is a huge plus. Unfortunately, there isn''t a real wow factor to the image as the subject is too small to have any significant impact - despite it''s technical excellance, it falls short of being artistically impressive. Originally rated a 6, it''s rerated to an 8 because of it''s technical competance.', '2009-04-30 09:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458545, 785457, 101256, '<td valign="top">On the first ratings pass, this failed to impress on several levels. When returning to make the comment pass, this reviewer was clearly mistaken. A very effective image from both an artistic and technical standpoint, the rich detail in the foreground and the incredibly effective use of bokeh to create a feeling of depth and dimension is stellar. Additionally, there is a element of humor in this image which is always appreciated. Many complimentary aspects to the image from a technical and artistic standpoint, this image was originally rated a 6 - it has been rerated a 10. This should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'On the first ratings pass, this failed to impress on several levels. When returning to make the comment pass, this reviewer was clearly mistaken. A very effective image from both an artistic and technical standpoint, the rich detail in the foreground and the incredibly effective use of bokeh to create a feeling of depth and dimension is stellar. Additionally, there is a element of humor in this image which is always appreciated. Many complimentary aspects to the image from a technical and artistic standpoint, this image was originally rated a 6 - it has been rerated a 10. This should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-30 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458790, 785544, 101256, '<td valign="top">Originally rated a 6 because of the impression of not quite meeting the challenge subject, it''s been rerated as a 10 because of it''s technical excellance and artistic impact enough it doesn''t quite meet the challenge criteria. The colors, shades and crisp detail along with terrific use of bokeh to balance the image is incredible - better than any of the images viewed so far in the challenge. Everything is perfectly in balance in this image and while it doesn''t quite meet the challenge subject, it is brilliant in so many ways it''s hard to describe. Well done.</td>', 'Originally rated a 6 because of the impression of not quite meeting the challenge subject, it''s been rerated as a 10 because of it''s technical excellance and artistic impact enough it doesn''t quite meet the challenge criteria. The colors, shades and crisp detail along with terrific use of bokeh to balance the image is incredible - better than any of the images viewed so far in the challenge. Everything is perfectly in balance in this image and while it doesn''t quite meet the challenge subject, it is brilliant in so many ways it''s hard to describe. Well done.', '2009-04-30 12:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458795, 785196, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.</td>', 'A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.', '2009-04-30 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458799, 785443, 101256, '<td valign="top">A curious theme in this challenge are images being too tall. This image would have presented a much more positive impression if it had been shorter concentrating the viewer on the bird and not the background. With a little shorter image, the viewers eye would be attracted to the bird rather than the background increasing the soft focus effect from a negative to a positive. It''s almost abstract in concept and that to this reviewer is a plus. While size is a minor issue, sometimes it can have great impact on an image and this is one of those instances. A good solid entry into the challenge originally rated a 6 and rerated to a 7.</td>', 'A curious theme in this challenge are images being too tall. This image would have presented a much more positive impression if it had been shorter concentrating the viewer on the bird and not the background. With a little shorter image, the viewers eye would be attracted to the bird rather than the background increasing the soft focus effect from a negative to a positive. It''s almost abstract in concept and that to this reviewer is a plus. While size is a minor issue, sometimes it can have great impact on an image and this is one of those instances. A good solid entry into the challenge originally rated a 6 and rerated to a 7.', '2009-04-30 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458800, 785314, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.</td>', 'A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.', '2009-04-30 12:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458801, 784884, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.</td>', 'A very interesting image that suffers from a just shy of sharp focus. Technically, it needs crisp and detailed image to pull of a positive artistic impression. While an intriguing situation, the lack of detail causes the eye to wander around looking for something to interest the viewer. Oddly, the lighting situation may be at fault for this, but at the same time, could have been made better by a slight alteration of aperature or shutter speed. A good entry into the challenge, it falls short of having any significant impact.', '2009-04-30 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
