(5458807, 785561, 101256, '<td valign="top">It often hard to understand why certain choices are made when submitting images for competition. In this case, it''s even more odd because of the excellant large floral component contrasting with the little and largely undetailed bee. The over whelming green background and foreground is perfectly controlled and the offset flower is artistically pleasing but the large and small comparision is automatically made and the eye tracks to the larger object. Technically a terrific image for any other type of flora challenge. Originally rated a 5 for the above stated reasons, it has been rerated a 6 for it''s technical competance.</td>', 'It often hard to understand why certain choices are made when submitting images for competition. In this case, it''s even more odd because of the excellant large floral component contrasting with the little and largely undetailed bee. The over whelming green background and foreground is perfectly controlled and the offset flower is artistically pleasing but the large and small comparision is automatically made and the eye tracks to the larger object. Technically a terrific image for any other type of flora challenge. Originally rated a 5 for the above stated reasons, it has been rerated a 6 for it''s technical competance.', '2009-04-30 13:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458810, 785587, 101256, '<td valign="top">An odd man out image diametrically opposed to the challenge subject, the humor expressed by the title/image is appreciated. However, as an entry, it fails to impress from either a technical or artistic standpoint. Originally rated a five for the above reasons, it has been rerated a 6 for it''s humor component.</td>', 'An odd man out image diametrically opposed to the challenge subject, the humor expressed by the title/image is appreciated. However, as an entry, it fails to impress from either a technical or artistic standpoint. Originally rated a five for the above reasons, it has been rerated a 6 for it''s humor component.', '2009-04-30 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
