(5459122, 784837, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love it! Not least because of the anonymity of the rider, under his huge hat. Also, loving the ghosted legs, "scratched" sky and lovely lines of detail in mane and tail. Magic!</td>', 'Love it! Not least because of the anonymity of the rider, under his huge hat. Also, loving the ghosted legs, "scratched" sky and lovely lines of detail in mane and tail. Magic!', '2009-04-30 17:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
