(5459132, 785265, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of the many dog captures. Why? Because you''ve got down low (whether on your belly or making use of an incline) to take the photograph from below the animal''s position. Amongst all the other''s taken from a higher perspective, this one stands out as really representing the joyous leap of the dog. It''s also a lovely capture in terms of light in his eyes, detail in his fur and clean and uncluttered background with well-chosen DOF.</td>', 'This is my favourite of the many dog captures. Why? Because you''ve got down low (whether on your belly or making use of an incline) to take the photograph from below the animal''s position. Amongst all the other''s taken from a higher perspective, this one stands out as really representing the joyous leap of the dog. It''s also a lovely capture in terms of light in his eyes, detail in his fur and clean and uncluttered background with well-chosen DOF.', '2009-04-30 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
