(5459609, 785497, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent capture. <strike>7 </strike>, back to review again , bumping up to 8. The colors and saturation are all excellent. Excellent planning. Probably the downside IMO is that the background is just a little messy for my preference. I would probably have selected the background and reduced highlights further and reduced saturation further to make the fish "pop" more. Just my suggestion</td>', 'excellent capture. 7 , back to review again , bumping up to 8. The colors and saturation are all excellent. Excellent planning. Probably the downside IMO is that the background is just a little messy for my preference. I would probably have selected the background and reduced highlights further and reduced saturation further to make the fish "pop" more. Just my suggestion', '2009-04-30 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
