(5460362, 785127, 47487, '<td valign="top">You know you''re a photographer when you''re out and about and see a rattlesnake and you hope he DOESN''T get away before you get some good shots. :) Nice job!</td>', 'You know you''re a photographer when you''re out and about and see a rattlesnake and you hope he DOESN''T get away before you get some good shots. :) Nice job!', '2009-05-01 03:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
