(5465129, 784868, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice quality and colors.</td>', '8 - Nice quality and colors.', '2009-05-03 10:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465131, 784837, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like the swirls of movement and the character captured.</td>', '8 - Like the swirls of movement and the character captured.', '2009-05-03 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465132, 785519, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture - wish it were 720 for that little extra.</td>', '8 - Good capture - wish it were 720 for that little extra.', '2009-05-03 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465489, 785476, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice DOF really saves the less than ideal framing.</td>', 'nice DOF really saves the less than ideal framing.', '2009-05-03 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465503, 785259, 16106, '<td valign="top">I find the framing which lops off the top of the rider''s head distracting, but the subject matter and colors are lovely. The horse looks like an arab, looks like Crabbet breeding, is it?</td>', 'I find the framing which lops off the top of the rider''s head distracting, but the subject matter and colors are lovely. The horse looks like an arab, looks like Crabbet breeding, is it?', '2009-05-03 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465505, 785293, 16106, '<td valign="top">the focused eye makes a nice still point.</td>', 'the focused eye makes a nice still point.', '2009-05-03 13:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465509, 784522, 16106, '<td valign="top">The odd cyan of the blurred background mars an otherwise perfect subject matter and execution. Still one of the best in the group</td>', 'The odd cyan of the blurred background mars an otherwise perfect subject matter and execution. Still one of the best in the group', '2009-05-03 13:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465511, 785510, 16106, '<td valign="top">lovely sense of motion here with strong blues and greens, I wish there was a richer series of tones from black to white.</td>', 'lovely sense of motion here with strong blues and greens, I wish there was a richer series of tones from black to white.', '2009-05-03 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466267, 785503, 76585, '<td valign="top">An amazing capture, love the pp. The blurred dof makes the bird seem even more clear.Great work 10</td>', 'An amazing capture, love the pp. The blurred dof makes the bird seem even more clear.Great work 10', '2009-05-03 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466268, 785510, 76585, '<td valign="top">Amazing 10</td>', 'Amazing 10', '2009-05-03 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466271, 785485, 76585, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, I love the contrast. 10</td>', 'Amazing shot, I love the contrast. 10', '2009-05-03 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466287, 785531, 76585, '<td valign="top">Beauty in motion 10</td>', 'Beauty in motion 10', '2009-05-03 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466297, 785319, 105943, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  On the technical side, not sure if you were going with a slower shutter to show the motion.  I would like to see with a faster shutter to get the full effect of the water and better detail on the wings.</td>', 'Nice image.  On the technical side, not sure if you were going with a slower shutter to show the motion.  I would like to see with a faster shutter to get the full effect of the water and better detail on the wings.', '2009-05-03 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466300, 785454, 76585, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity and color. 10</td>', 'Amazing clarity and color. 10', '2009-05-03 21:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466303, 785522, 105943, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Well balanced, nice light and shadow contrast!</td>', 'Excellent!  Well balanced, nice light and shadow contrast!', '2009-05-03 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466311, 785581, 105943, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  I would like to see with a little tint to the background to highlight the white of the pelican.</td>', 'Very good photo.  I would like to see with a little tint to the background to highlight the white of the pelican.', '2009-05-03 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466315, 785547, 105943, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and nice detail on the dove.  Might play around with crop.</td>', 'Good DOF and nice detail on the dove.  Might play around with crop.', '2009-05-03 21:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466318, 785083, 105943, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail.  Would have been nice to have the entire bird, but I know sometimes models just don''t cooperate!</td>', 'Nice color and detail.  Would have been nice to have the entire bird, but I know sometimes models just don''t cooperate!', '2009-05-03 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466321, 785413, 105943, '<td valign="top">Good in every technical aspect, but the thing that stuck me the most is the fact that the horse appears to be floating!</td>', 'Good in every technical aspect, but the thing that stuck me the most is the fact that the horse appears to be floating!', '2009-05-03 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466326, 784994, 105943, '<td valign="top">Background is too distracting, otherwise nice photo of a flying fish.</td>', 'Background is too distracting, otherwise nice photo of a flying fish.', '2009-05-03 21:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466330, 784951, 105943, '<td valign="top">The title makes it that much better.</td>', 'The title makes it that much better.', '2009-05-03 21:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466338, 785265, 105943, '<td valign="top">Very good.  The only thing I can offer is that a different crop might give better balance.</td>', 'Very good.  The only thing I can offer is that a different crop might give better balance.', '2009-05-03 21:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466347, 785589, 105943, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic touch.</td>', 'Nice artistic touch.', '2009-05-03 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466357, 784522, 105943, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2009-05-03 21:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466391, 785199, 105943, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  A little over edited IMO.  Could have benefited from some additional contrast between the duck and water.</td>', 'Good photo.  A little over edited IMO.  Could have benefited from some additional contrast between the duck and water.', '2009-05-03 21:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466399, 784837, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how the motion makes it milky. Reminds me of Manet. 9</td>', 'I love how the motion makes it milky. Reminds me of Manet. 9', '2009-05-03 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466401, 785457, 105943, '<td valign="top">Love the concept!  Bet that was a fun one to set up.</td>', 'Love the concept!  Bet that was a fun one to set up.', '2009-05-03 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466424, 785531, 105943, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Excellent foreground/background contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Excellent foreground/background contrast.', '2009-05-03 21:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466432, 785256, 86447, '<td valign="top">Awww, Judi, he/she''s growing up to be so pretty!</td>', 'Awww, Judi, he/she''s growing up to be so pretty!', '2009-05-03 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466433, 785559, 86447, '<td valign="top">Good motion here!</td>', 'Good motion here!', '2009-05-03 21:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466434, 785465, 86447, '<td valign="top">Odd halo around the bird... from PS?<br/> <br/>Nicely composed.</td>', 'Odd halo around the bird... from PS? Nicely composed.', '2009-05-03 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466435, 785590, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m sure folks either love the partial desat or hate it.  I think it really highlights your subject well.</td>', 'I''m sure folks either love the partial desat or hate it.  I think it really highlights your subject well.', '2009-05-03 21:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466437, 785572, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2009-05-03 21:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466438, 785584, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh... if only the rest of the feet were there, this would score much more highly.<br/> <br/>As it is, I like it... it makes me cheer for him/her to go higher.</td>', 'Oh... if only the rest of the feet were there, this would score much more highly. As it is, I like it... it makes me cheer for him/her to go higher.', '2009-05-03 21:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466440, 785294, 86447, '<td valign="top">There''s something wrong with either the sharpening here or my monitor.  But, the capture is timed perfectly and the water motion is wonderful.</td>', 'There''s something wrong with either the sharpening here or my monitor.  But, the capture is timed perfectly and the water motion is wonderful.', '2009-05-03 21:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466441, 785497, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and motion!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and motion!', '2009-05-03 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466443, 785557, 86447, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile every time  I look at it.   Running just for the joy of it.</td>', 'This makes me smile every time  I look at it.   Running just for the joy of it.', '2009-05-03 21:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466447, 785583, 86447, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS!   I love seeing a bird in flight so close to the ground.   Rare and well done.</td>', 'FABULOUS!   I love seeing a bird in flight so close to the ground.   Rare and well done.', '2009-05-03 21:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466448, 784465, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL @ your title!  :)    Nice and sharp on that hippo''s eye, too.</td>', 'LOL @ your title!  :)    Nice and sharp on that hippo''s eye, too.', '2009-05-03 21:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466465, 785525, 105943, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mallard.  Might have cropped down a little to make the background less distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful mallard.  Might have cropped down a little to make the background less distracting.', '2009-05-03 21:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466466, 785518, 86447, '<td valign="top">They''re ADORABLE, Brent!!!</td>', 'They''re ADORABLE, Brent!!!', '2009-05-03 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466702, 785644, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful closeup of these very unpredictable creatures. Beautiful capture of the eyes and texture around the beak of the stationary bird, and of the red of the legs against the white of the body and tail of the bird in flight.</td>', 'Wonderful closeup of these very unpredictable creatures. Beautiful capture of the eyes and texture around the beak of the stationary bird, and of the red of the legs against the white of the body and tail of the bird in flight.', '2009-05-03 23:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466730, 785565, 96915, '<td valign="top">I like posture and movement of the horse a lot, but the strange blur processing spoils this for me.</td>', 'I like posture and movement of the horse a lot, but the strange blur processing spoils this for me.', '2009-05-03 23:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466751, 785585, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such a happy doggy!!!</td>', 'Such a happy doggy!!!', '2009-05-03 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466752, 785518, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh look at those guys. So cute.  Norwich? Cairn?</td>', 'Oh look at those guys. So cute.  Norwich? Cairn?', '2009-05-04 00:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466754, 785589, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL - that classic poem and a dog peeing. HAHAHAHAHA</td>', 'ROFL - that classic poem and a dog peeing. HAHAHAHAHA', '2009-05-04 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466758, 785054, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THAT!!!!</td>', 'LOVE THAT!!!!', '2009-05-04 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466760, 784868, 15711, '<td valign="top">I have that exact feeder and not one bird came.  :~(</td>', 'I have that exact feeder and not one bird came.  :~(', '2009-05-04 00:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466764, 784654, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  I love those vibrant eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  I love those vibrant eyes.', '2009-05-04 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466765, 785265, 67697, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture in the air.  I love that focused and intent look on the dog''s face.</td>', 'Awesome capture in the air.  I love that focused and intent look on the dog''s face.', '2009-05-04 00:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
