(5467014, 785199, 65319, '<td valign="top">I loved this one.  I''m one of your six 10''s.  well done!</td>', 'I loved this one.  I''m one of your six 10''s.  well done!', '2009-05-04 02:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467027, 785510, 65319, '<td valign="top">Lynne thought this one was mine...and the only thing wrong with this photo is that it isn''t sitting in my portfolio!  I voted this one a 9 and am appalled to see it way down here!  This is a cool motion blur photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Lynne thought this one was mine...and the only thing wrong with this photo is that it isn''t sitting in my portfolio!  I voted this one a 9 and am appalled to see it way down here!  This is a cool motion blur photo.  Well done!', '2009-05-04 02:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467031, 784654, 52549, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image, Andrew! Great clarity, really excellent. Congrats on winning.</td>', 'Brilliant image, Andrew! Great clarity, really excellent. Congrats on winning.', '2009-05-04 02:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467032, 784837, 6804, '<td valign="top">There were some great shots in this challenge, but this one was by far my favorite shot of the bunch.  This is an amazing capture on so many levels.  The combination of just the right amount of motion and clarity within a single capture is very difficult to achieve.  Being able to apply the technique perfectly to the ideal subject makes for a remarkable work of art.<br/> <br/>Its no secret that blur images dont seem to score as well with the DPC voters, but I have to admit; I am shocked to see where this one finish. <br/> <br/>You have a real talent in your execution of motion blur Mae. <br/>Kudos on you for a very awesome entry. <br/></td>', 'There were some great shots in this challenge, but this one was by far my favorite shot of the bunch.  This is an amazing capture on so many levels.  The combination of just the right amount of motion and clarity within a single capture is very difficult to achieve.  Being able to apply the technique perfectly to the ideal subject makes for a remarkable work of art. Its no secret that blur images dont seem to score as well with the DPC voters, but I have to admit; I am shocked to see where this one finish.  You have a real talent in your execution of motion blur Mae. Kudos on you for a very awesome entry. ', '2009-05-04 02:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467034, 784926, 42135, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I knew you could recreate something as exciting as your DQ. I''ve been waiting and wonderfully rewarded!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I knew you could recreate something as exciting as your DQ. I''ve been waiting and wonderfully rewarded!', '2009-05-04 02:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467039, 785477, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wooohoooooo!  Congrats on this spectacular image, new personal best, and your first ribbon!</td>', 'Wooohoooooo!  Congrats on this spectacular image, new personal best, and your first ribbon!', '2009-05-04 02:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467040, 785443, 65319, '<td valign="top">I have this photo a 7.  People don''t really appreciate how hard it is to get good blur where the wing is perpendicular to the water so perfectly as shown in this photo.  When the bird is flying directly into the light, then the blur become much more dramatic when shot from the bird''s side.  The lighting works a little bit against you in this shot because his face is in shadow.  The wing and the water are beautiful and well photographed!  <br/> <br/>I always enjoy photos like this and am disappointed in the voters to see it down here.  Bah!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-04 01:19:22.</i></td>', 'I have this photo a 7.  People don''t really appreciate how hard it is to get good blur where the wing is perpendicular to the water so perfectly as shown in this photo.  When the bird is flying directly into the light, then the blur become much more dramatic when shot from the bird''s side.  The lighting works a little bit against you in this shot because his face is in shadow.  The wing and the water are beautiful and well photographed!   I always enjoy photos like this and am disappointed in the voters to see it down here.  Bah!', '2009-05-04 02:17:59.000000', '2009-05-04 02:19:22.000000', 0),
(5467045, 784866, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super shot Sandy!!! This is a great capture.</td>', 'Super shot Sandy!!! This is a great capture.', '2009-05-04 02:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467046, 785265, 67145, '<td valign="top">i looked thru the challenge and when i came to this one i was blown away .. <br/>was hoping like mad it would do well in this challenge with the birds and exotic stuff .. an ordinary dog doing wot dogs do  .... its the most amazing shot .. catching a dog at high speed like that, coming straight towards you is no mean feat .. CONGRATULATIONS on the HM, such a great place in the challenge and a killer shot .. :)</td>', 'i looked thru the challenge and when i came to this one i was blown away .. was hoping like mad it would do well in this challenge with the birds and exotic stuff .. an ordinary dog doing wot dogs do  .... its the most amazing shot .. catching a dog at high speed like that, coming straight towards you is no mean feat .. CONGRATULATIONS on the HM, such a great place in the challenge and a killer shot .. :)', '2009-05-04 02:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
