(5467059, 784866, 67145, '<td valign="top">man this is the cutest little bird i ever saw .. <br/>those little tucked in legs are such a sight .. makes me just want to say awwwwwwww out loud .. how embarrassing .!!!. lol <br/>sandy .. this is the most excellent shot .. i cant imagine how difficult it would be to photograph one of these little fellows .. i''ve never actually seen one, but i believe they are very small and very very very quick .. <br/>i particularly love the way the bird is so sharp and the background a blur .. takes great skill to get a shot like this .. WOW .. !!..:)</td>', 'man this is the cutest little bird i ever saw .. those little tucked in legs are such a sight .. makes me just want to say awwwwwwww out loud .. how embarrassing .!!!. lol sandy .. this is the most excellent shot .. i cant imagine how difficult it would be to photograph one of these little fellows .. i''ve never actually seen one, but i believe they are very small and very very very quick .. i particularly love the way the bird is so sharp and the background a blur .. takes great skill to get a shot like this .. WOW .. !!..:)', '2009-05-04 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
