(5467066, 784654, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, Andrew, no one could have hit the nail on the head as well as you did with this spectacular entry.  BRAVO!!!!!!!</td>', 'Well, Andrew, no one could have hit the nail on the head as well as you did with this spectacular entry.  BRAVO!!!!!!!', '2009-05-04 02:33:24.000000', NULL, 0),
