(5467070, 785430, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. this is spectacular .. i love the amazing clarity and the quality of the photograph .. <br/>you''ve captured such grace and beauty .. the bird against the clear sky is excellent .. makes him stand out with no distractions at all .. once again i think totally differently to everyone else ..!!!!<br/>notice you took this with the 1D .. you''re off to a great start considering you''re not used to using it yet .. WOW .. !!..:)</td>', 'OMG .. this is spectacular .. i love the amazing clarity and the quality of the photograph .. you''ve captured such grace and beauty .. the bird against the clear sky is excellent .. makes him stand out with no distractions at all .. once again i think totally differently to everyone else ..!!!!notice you took this with the 1D .. you''re off to a great start considering you''re not used to using it yet .. WOW .. !!..:)', '2009-05-04 02:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467071, 784657, 79955, '<td valign="top">Yup , I was right. did not deserve the score you received. did not leave a comment earlier, gave you a 6. composition is good , colors are good. Yes it could have been sharper still... the voters should not have been that harsh.</td>', 'Yup , I was right. did not deserve the score you received. did not leave a comment earlier, gave you a 6. composition is good , colors are good. Yes it could have been sharper still... the voters should not have been that harsh.', '2009-05-04 02:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467073, 785572, 65319, '<td valign="top">Bah...on the voters!  Very disappointed to see this one down here!  To cheer myself up, I''m placing this one straight into my favs!</td>', 'Bah...on the voters!  Very disappointed to see this one down here!  To cheer myself up, I''m placing this one straight into my favs!', '2009-05-04 02:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467074, 785531, 67145, '<td valign="top">great shot jaime .. it looks almost like your dog has morphed into a bird .. dont know why i even thought that .. maybe i''m going silly .. or sillier .. particularly love the way the bird is nearly horizontal but not quite and stands out so well against that green background ..  :) ...</td>', 'great shot jaime .. it looks almost like your dog has morphed into a bird .. dont know why i even thought that .. maybe i''m going silly .. or sillier .. particularly love the way the bird is nearly horizontal but not quite and stands out so well against that green background ..  :) ...', '2009-05-04 02:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467075, 784654, 31637, '<td valign="top">I love owls...congratulations, thx for details.</td>', 'I love owls...congratulations, thx for details.', '2009-05-04 02:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467077, 785293, 67145, '<td valign="top">this one totally wow''ed me in the challenge .. the amazing clarity of the dog and the way he''s looking straight at me .. its such a brilliant image .. i was expecting to see it at least on the front page .. :)</td>', 'this one totally wow''ed me in the challenge .. the amazing clarity of the dog and the way he''s looking straight at me .. its such a brilliant image .. i was expecting to see it at least on the front page .. :)', '2009-05-04 02:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467079, 785020, 67145, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot .. love the vibrant background and the bird so well defined against it .. congrats on such an amazing shot .. :)</td>', 'fantastic shot .. love the vibrant background and the bird so well defined against it .. congrats on such an amazing shot .. :)', '2009-05-04 02:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467081, 785477, 31637, '<td valign="top">This really stands out as a marvelous action shot, nice to win your first ribbon, congratulations!</td>', 'This really stands out as a marvelous action shot, nice to win your first ribbon, congratulations!', '2009-05-04 02:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
