(5471805, 785577, 68586, '<td valign="top">Such a delightful shot . . should be in a magazine somewhere</td>', 'Such a delightful shot . . should be in a magazine somewhere', '2009-05-06 03:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5471859, 784654, 69983, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Congrats on the ribbon. I liked this shot when I saw it, I actually didnt think it would ribbon, only for the fact that it is a captive bird and being a long time bird in flight photographer it does take away from the degree of difficulty, That and the fact that head is oversharpened, which would lead me to believe that you were compensating for softness elswhere? Overall a very stunning capture here on DPChallenge, In the bird photography world above average...</td>', 'Great capture! Congrats on the ribbon. I liked this shot when I saw it, I actually didnt think it would ribbon, only for the fact that it is a captive bird and being a long time bird in flight photographer it does take away from the degree of difficulty, That and the fact that head is oversharpened, which would lead me to believe that you were compensating for softness elswhere? Overall a very stunning capture here on DPChallenge, In the bird photography world above average...', '2009-05-06 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5471864, 784926, 69983, '<td valign="top">This is the shot I thought would get the blue, having 3 bird photos in the top 3, this is the only non captive shot, both birds are very well processed and natural looking. I guess they dont give points for degree of difficulty here! Very well done..</td>', 'This is the shot I thought would get the blue, having 3 bird photos in the top 3, this is the only non captive shot, both birds are very well processed and natural looking. I guess they dont give points for degree of difficulty here! Very well done..', '2009-05-06 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
