(5472203, 785265, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh no!!!  I am so sorry!  I''m sending you and Molly a big hug too!   I know its "a challenge" to stay in the rules -- but sometimes -- the restrictive rules just keep us from being able to make our photos the best they can be!  This is so amazing -- and you will treasure it forever.   Long after the challenge is forgotten.  I think I woul rather have a photo exactly like this of my beloved "furry child" than a high placing in a challenge anyway.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on this AMAZING photo of Molly!<br/> <br/>(( Hug  ))</td>', 'Oh no!!!  I am so sorry!  I''m sending you and Molly a big hug too!   I know its "a challenge" to stay in the rules -- but sometimes -- the restrictive rules just keep us from being able to make our photos the best they can be!  This is so amazing -- and you will treasure it forever.   Long after the challenge is forgotten.  I think I woul rather have a photo exactly like this of my beloved "furry child" than a high placing in a challenge anyway. Congratulations on this AMAZING photo of Molly! (( Hug  ))', '2009-05-06 09:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
